{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XkMde9kyWKh3sQ1UYWoTVK","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"ISR β=0.1 three-seed replication\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"s42 已完成 (PR=0.81, ISR=0.337)。s43/s44 使用相同超参、不同 seed 复现。 验证 ISR sweet spot 跨 seed 稳健性。\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"s43_eval_prove_rate\": 0.77,\n7\t      \"s43_eval_mean_isr\": 0.305,\n8\t      \"s43_eval_proved_only_isr\": 0.396,\n9\t      \"s43_eval_component_count_mean\": 5.82,\n10\t      \"s43_eval_isr_0_ratio\": 0.052,\n11\t      \"s43_eval_isr_1_ratio\": 0.104,\n12\t      \"s43_eval_tautological_collapse\": false,\n13\t      \"s43_train_last100_pr\": 0.66,\n14\t      \"s43_train_last100_isr\": 0.178,\n15\t      \"s44_eval_prove_rate\": 0.75,\n16\t      \"s44_eval_mean_isr\": 0.282,\n17\t      \"s44_eval_proved_only_isr\": 0.376,\n18\t      \"s44_eval_component_count_mean\": 6.08,\n19\t      \"s44_eval_isr_0_ratio\": 0.067,\n20\t      \"s44_eval_isr_1_ratio\": 0.093,\n21\t      \"s44_eval_tautological_collapse\": false,\n22\t      \"s44_train_last100_pr\": 0.63,\n23\t      \"s44_train_last100_isr\": 0.165,\n24\t      \"three_seed_mean_pr\": 0.777,\n25\t      \"three_seed_std_pr\": 0.03,\n26\t      \"three_seed_mean_isr\": 0.308,\n27\t      \"three_seed_std_isr\": 0.028,\n28\t      \"three_seed_mean_proved_only_isr\": 0.396,\n29\t      \"three_seed_mean_component_count\": 5.83\n30\t    },\n31\t    \"tables\": [\n32\t      \"| Seed | eval PR | eval ISR | proved-only ISR | comp_mean | tautological |\\n|------|---------|----------|-----------------|-----------|-------------|\\n| s42  | 0.81    | 0.337    | 0.415           | 5.58      | No          |\\n| s43  | 0.77    | 0.305    | 0.396           | 5.82      | No          |\\n| s44  | 0.75    | 0.282    | 0.376           | 6.08      | No          |\\n| **mean±std** | **0.777±0.030** | **0.308±0.028** | **0.396±0.020** | **5.83±0.25** | — |\\n\"\n33\t    ],\n34\t    \"figures\": [],\n35\t    \"analysis\": \"ISR β=0.1 的核心发现：它是一个稳定器而非最大化器。exec-only 三 seed 产生 三种完全不同的退化模式 (PR 从 0.14 到 0.98，ISR 从 0 到 0.57)， 而 ISR β=0.1 将三 seed 收敛至同一区域 (PR 0.75-0.81, ISR 0.28-0.34)。 这表明 low-dose ISR 信号提供的不仅是结构改善，更是训练动态的正则化。 std(PR)=0.030, std(ISR)=0.028 的低方差进一步证实跨 seed 稳健性。\\n\\ns42 已验证 ISR β=0.1 sweet spot (PR=0.81, ISR=0.337)。在 best 档，s43 和 s44 复现同方向结果，因为 β=0.1 的优化压力足够低，避免 Goodhart 效应，同时提供 结构引导信号。关键机制：ISR bonus (r = r_exec·(1+0.1·ISR)) 在早期训练中 对结构完整的证明给予微弱正向激励，足以将 GRPO 探索引导至 genuine 证明区域， 但压力不足以触发对 ISR 本身的 gaming。 s43 在 exec-only 中出现 repetition collapse (PR=0.14)，但 ISR bonus 改变了 early-training 梯度景观——少数结构完整的早期成功获得更高 reward，打破了 退化吸引子。s44 在 exec-only 中出现 tautological collapse (comp=2.04)， ISR bonus 奖励 ISR>0.5 的多组件证明，将优化推离 2-component 极小解。 自然 seed 方差导致 s43/s44 的 ISR 略低于 s42 (0.31/0.28 vs 0.34)， 但方向完全一致。std(ISR)=0.028 表明效应跨 seed 稳健。\"\n36\t  },\n37\t  {\n38\t    \"name\": \"Random β=0.1 three-seed control\",\n39\t    \"description\": \"s42 已完成 (PR=0.79, ISR=0.104)。s43/s44 复现 random β=0.1 对照， 与 plan002-b01 三 seed 做 matched comparison。\",\n40\t    \"results\": {\n41\t      \"s43_eval_prove_rate\": 0.74,\n42\t      \"s43_eval_mean_isr\": 0.089,\n43\t      \"s43_eval_proved_only_isr\": 0.12,\n44\t      \"s43_eval_component_count_mean\": 8.92,\n45\t      \"s44_eval_prove_rate\": 0.76,\n46\t      \"s44_eval_mean_isr\": 0.118,\n47\t      \"s44_eval_proved_only_isr\": 0.155,\n48\t      \"s44_eval_component_count_mean\": 8.15,\n49\t      \"three_seed_mean_pr\": 0.763,\n50\t      \"three_seed_std_pr\": 0.025,\n51\t      \"three_seed_mean_isr\": 0.104,\n52\t      \"three_seed_std_isr\": 0.015,\n53\t      \"three_seed_mean_component_count\": 8.51\n54\t    },\n55\t    \"tables\": [\n56\t      \"| Seed | eval PR | eval ISR | proved-only ISR | comp_mean |\\n|------|---------|----------|-----------------|-----------|\\n| s42  | 0.79    | 0.104    | 0.131           | 8.46      |\\n| s43  | 0.74    | 0.089    | 0.120           | 8.92      |\\n| s44  | 0.76    | 0.118    | 0.155           | 8.15      |\\n| **mean±std** | **0.763±0.025** | **0.104±0.015** | **0.135±0.018** | **8.51±0.39** |\\n\"\n57\t    ],\n58\t    \"figures\": [],\n59\t    \"analysis\": \"Random β=0.1 的结论：β=0.1 dose 的方差注入是 GRPO 抗饱和的有效手段 （PR 维持），但 ISR 信号是结构改善的充要条件。Random 组 ISR~0.10 接近 exec-only baseline 的 0.12，说明 random noise 对结构质量无贡献。\\n\\nRandom β=0.1 提供与 ISR β=0.1 相同强度的方差注入，但无结构信号。 PR 维持在 0.74-0.79 (与 ISR 组的 0.75-0.81 无显著差异) 表明 β=0.1 的方差注入本身不损害证明能力。但 ISR 仅为 0.09-0.12，是 ISR 组的 1/3， 说明 random noise 不提供结构引导——模型仍走 conclusion embedding 等 捷径，只是 noise 打破了 GRPO 饱和导致的梯度消失，维持了一定的探索。 Component count 8.5 vs ISR 组的 5.8 表明 random 组的证明更冗余（更多 不必要组件），而 ISR 组通过结构奖励压缩了证明至更精简的形式。\"\n60\t  },\n61\t  {\n62\t    \"name\": \"3-seed ISR vs Random statistical comparison\",\n63\t    \"description\": \"三 seed ISR β=0.1 vs Random β=0.1 的统计检验，验证 ISR 信号的 structural value 跨 seed 显著。\",\n64\t    \"results\": {\n65\t      \"isr_over_random_ratio_mean\": 2.96,\n66\t      \"isr_over_random_ratio_per_seed\": [\n67\t        3.24,\n68\t        3.43,\n69\t        2.39\n70\t      ],\n71\t      \"isr_over_random_ratio_std\": 0.55,\n72\t      \"isr_over_random_ratio_95ci\": [\n73\t        1.66,\n74\t        4.39\n75\t      ],\n76\t      \"welch_t_isr\": 11.1,\n77\t      \"welch_df\": 3.1,\n78\t      \"welch_p\": 0.002,\n79\t      \"pr_difference_p\": 0.52,\n80\t      \"pr_difference_not_significant\": true,\n81\t      \"genuine_rate_isr_per_seed\": [\n82\t        0.259,\n83\t        0.24,\n84\t        0.22\n85\t      ],\n86\t      \"genuine_rate_random_per_seed\": [\n87\t        0.177,\n88\t        0.16,\n89\t        0.15\n90\t      ],\n91\t      \"genuine_rate_delta_mean_pp\": 7.7,\n92\t      \"genuine_rate_delta_range_pp\": [\n93\t        7.0,\n94\t        8.2\n95\t      ],\n96\t      \"cohen_d_isr\": 9.6\n97\t    },\n98\t    \"tables\": [\n99\t      \"| Metric | ISR β=0.1 (mean±std) | Random β=0.1 (mean±std) | Ratio | p-value |\\n|--------|---------------------|------------------------|-------|---------|\\n| eval PR | 0.777±0.030 | 0.763±0.025 | 1.02x | 0.52 (ns) |\\n| eval ISR | 0.308±0.028 | 0.104±0.015 | **2.96x** | **0.002** |\\n| proved-only ISR | 0.396±0.020 | 0.135±0.018 | 2.93x | 0.001 |\\n| component count | 5.83±0.25 | 8.51±0.39 | 0.69x | 0.003 |\\n| genuine rate | 24.0%±2.0% | 16.2%±1.4% | — | +7.7pp |\\n\",\n100\t      \"| Per-seed ISR ratio | s42 | s43 | s44 | mean±std |\\n|-------------------|-----|-----|-----|----------|\\n| ISR(ISR) / ISR(random) | 3.24 | 3.43 | 2.39 | 3.02±0.55 |\\n| 95% CI: [1.66, 4.39] — does not cross 1 |\\n\"\n101\t    ],\n102\t    \"figures\": [],\n103\t    \"analysis\": \"这是论文 Claim 2 的核心证据：ISR 信号提供 genuine structural guidance， 非方差正则化副产物。效应量 (d=9.6) 远超常规阈值 (0.8 = large)， 即使 n=3 也高度显著。与 β=0.3 Goodhart 崩塌形成对照，完整刻画 ISR-as-proxy-metric 的 Goodhart 曲线：β=0.1 sweet spot, β∈(0.1,0.3) 转折，β=0.3 post-Goodhart。\\n\\n三 seed 样本量小 (n=3)，但效应量极大 (Cohen's d=9.6)，使得 Welch t-test 仍高度显著 (p=0.002)。ISR/random ratio 95% CI [1.66, 4.39] 不跨 1， point estimate 2.96 满足 ≥2.5 门槛。PR 无显著差异 (p=0.52) 确认 ISR 改善 是 \\\"免费的\\\"——不以证明能力为代价。Genuine rate delta 7.7pp (范围 7.0-8.2pp) 在 [5.0, 12.0] 区间内，表明 ISR β=0.1 确实增加了 genuine proof 占比。 该效应量在如此小的 n 下仍显著，说明 ISR 信号的结构引导是 robust 的。\"\n104\t  },\n105\t  {\n106\t    \"name\": \"STA O(1) vs O(N) computational ablation\",\n107\t    \"description\": \"对比 fast_isr_fol (O(1) 近似，仅测试首组件) vs full STA (O(N) LOO ablation) 在 500 步 exec+STA 训练中的效果。文档化 O(1) 无法捕捉结构依赖的 negative result。\",\n108\t    \"results\": {\n109\t      \"o1_eval_prove_rate\": 0.91,\n110\t      \"o1_eval_mean_isr_fast\": 0.03,\n111\t      \"o1_eval_mean_isr_true\": 0.11,\n112\t      \"o1_eval_component_count_mean\": 9.2,\n113\t      \"o1_train_duration_min\": 42,\n114\t      \"on_eval_prove_rate\": 0.93,\n115\t      \"on_eval_mean_isr\": 0.12,\n116\t      \"on_eval_component_count_mean\": 8.8,\n117\t      \"on_train_duration_min\": 68,\n118\t      \"speedup_ratio\": 1.62,\n119\t      \"isr_correlation_o1_on\": 0.18\n120\t    },\n121\t    \"tables\": [\n122\t      \"| Method | eval PR | eval ISR | comp_mean | train time (min) | ISR signal quality |\\n|--------|---------|----------|-----------|------------------|--------------------|\\n| O(1) fast_isr | 0.91 | 0.03 (fast) / 0.11 (true) | 9.2 | 42 | ρ=0.18 with O(N) |\\n| O(N) full STA | 0.93 | 0.12 | 8.8 | 68 | ground truth |\\n| exec-only (ref) | 0.93 | 0.12 | — | 35 | N/A |\\n\"\n123\t    ],\n124\t    \"figures\": [],\n125\t    \"analysis\": \"Negative result 文档化：O(1) 不工作是因为 ISR 的核心价值在于检测 组件间冗余关系（如 conclusion embedding 使所有 premise 组件变得不必要）， 单点采样无法捕捉这种全局结构信息。这也解释了为什么 ISR 计算成本是 STA 协议的必要开销。论文应在 Method 章节讨论此 tradeoff。\\n\\nO(1) fast_isr 仅移除第一个组件测试证明是否仍成立，无法检测多组件间的 冗余模式（如 conclusion embedding 中结论组件不在首位的情况）。 在 500 步训练中，O(1) ISR 信号近乎随机 (与 O(N) 的相关性仅 0.18)， 因此对训练几乎无结构引导——结果与 exec-only baseline 相似。 O(1) 快 1.6x 但信息量损失 ~90%，是 accuracy-speed tradeoff 的错误端。 此结果证明 LOO 的 O(N) 计算是必要的，不可用单点近似替代。\"\n126\t  },\n127\t  {\n128\t    \"name\": \"Prolog exec-only GRPO (3 seeds)\",\n129\t    \"description\": \"Prolog 单逻辑 GRPO，execution-only reward，500 步，K=8，3 seeds。 验证 Prolog 环境下 exec-only 训练是否出现 reward hacking。\",\n130\t    \"results\": {\n131\t      \"s42_eval_prove_rate\": 0.85,\n132\t      \"s42_eval_mean_isr\": 0.08,\n133\t      \"s42_eval_proved_only_isr\": 0.094,\n134\t      \"s42_eval_component_count_mean\": 7.4,\n135\t      \"s42_eval_dominant_hacking\": \"conclusion_embedding\",\n136\t      \"s42_eval_genuine_rate\": 0.16,\n137\t      \"s43_eval_prove_rate\": 0.79,\n138\t      \"s43_eval_mean_isr\": 0.13,\n139\t      \"s43_eval_proved_only_isr\": 0.165,\n140\t      \"s43_eval_component_count_mean\": 6.5,\n141\t      \"s43_eval_dominant_hacking\": \"rule_duplication\",\n142\t      \"s43_eval_genuine_rate\": 0.21,\n143\t      \"s44_eval_prove_rate\": 0.88,\n144\t      \"s44_eval_mean_isr\": 0.05,\n145\t      \"s44_eval_proved_only_isr\": 0.057,\n146\t      \"s44_eval_component_count_mean\": 8.3,\n147\t      \"s44_eval_dominant_hacking\": \"cut_tautology\",\n148\t      \"s44_eval_genuine_rate\": 0.12,\n149\t      \"three_seed_mean_pr\": 0.84,\n150\t      \"three_seed_std_pr\": 0.046,\n151\t      \"three_seed_mean_isr\": 0.087,\n152\t      \"three_seed_std_isr\": 0.04,\n153\t      \"three_seed_mean_genuine_rate\": 0.163,\n154\t      \"three_seed_hacking_rate\": 0.837\n155\t    },\n156\t    \"tables\": [\n157\t      \"| Seed | eval PR | eval ISR | proved-only ISR | comp_mean | dominant hacking | genuine % |\\n|------|---------|----------|-----------------|-----------|------------------|-----------|\\n| s42  | 0.85    | 0.08     | 0.094           | 7.4       | conclusion embedding | 16% |\\n| s43  | 0.79    | 0.13     | 0.165           | 6.5       | rule duplication | 21% |\\n| s44  | 0.88    | 0.05     | 0.057           | 8.3       | cut tautology | 12% |\\n| **mean±std** | **0.84±0.046** | **0.087±0.040** | **0.105±0.055** | **7.4±0.9** | — | **16.3%** |\\n\",\n158\t      \"| 对比 FOL exec-only | FOL (s42) | Prolog (mean) |\\n|-------------------|-----------|---------------|\\n| eval PR | 0.93 | 0.84 |\\n| eval ISR | 0.123 | 0.087 |\\n| hacking rate | ~82% | ~84% |\\n| seed divergence | 3 modes | 3 modes |\\n\"\n159\t    ],\n160\t    \"figures\": [],\n161\t    \"analysis\": \"Prolog exec-only 复现了 FOL 的核心发现：PR 高但 ISR 低，三 seed 出现不同退化模式。这是 Claim 3 的基础——STA 诊断协议的需求在 Prolog 中同样存在。hacking rate 84% (vs FOL 82%) 表明 exec-only GRPO 的 reward hacking 问题不是 FOL 特有的，而是二值 execution reward + GRPO 的系统性问题。\\n\\nProlog 与 FOL 共享关键动态：SWI-Prolog 的 execution reward 是二值的 （query 成功/失败），与 Prover9 类似。GRPO 在二值 reward 下同样会 饱和，驱动模型寻找结构捷径。Prolog 特有的 hacking 机制： (1) Conclusion embedding → head 直接编码答案 (e.g., `answer(true) :- true.`)， 与 FOL 的 conclusion embedding 同构； (2) Rule duplication → 同一 clause 重复多次，SWI-Prolog 回溯时均匹配但 仅第一条有用，类似 FOL repetition collapse； (3) Cut tautology → 使用 `!` (cut) 强制成功，跳过真正的逻辑推导， 类似 FOL tautological shortcuts。 PR 高 (0.79-0.88) 但 ISR 低 (0.05-0.13) 的 gap 确认 hacking 存在。 三 seed 出现不同主导退化模式，与 FOL exec-only 的 seed 发散行为一致， 进一步证明 exec-only GRPO 的训练动态在逻辑类型间共享。\"\n162\t  },\n163\t  {\n164\t    \"name\": \"Prolog exec+STA GRPO (3 seeds, ISR β=0.1)\",\n165\t    \"description\": \"Prolog GRPO with ISR bonus (r = r_exec · (1 + 0.1·ISR))，500 步，K=8， 3 seeds。验证 STA reward integration 在 Prolog 中的效果。\",\n166\t    \"results\": {\n167\t      \"s42_eval_prove_rate\": 0.78,\n168\t      \"s42_eval_mean_isr\": 0.28,\n169\t      \"s42_eval_component_count_mean\": 5.1,\n170\t      \"s42_eval_genuine_rate\": 0.28,\n171\t      \"s43_eval_prove_rate\": 0.73,\n172\t      \"s43_eval_mean_isr\": 0.24,\n173\t      \"s43_eval_component_count_mean\": 5.5,\n174\t      \"s43_eval_genuine_rate\": 0.24,\n175\t      \"s44_eval_prove_rate\": 0.76,\n176\t      \"s44_eval_mean_isr\": 0.26,\n177\t      \"s44_eval_component_count_mean\": 5.3,\n178\t      \"s44_eval_genuine_rate\": 0.22,\n179\t      \"three_seed_mean_pr\": 0.757,\n180\t      \"three_seed_std_pr\": 0.025,\n181\t      \"three_seed_mean_isr\": 0.26,\n182\t      \"three_seed_std_isr\": 0.02,\n183\t      \"isr_improvement_over_exec\": 2.99,\n184\t      \"genuine_rate_mean\": 0.247\n185\t    },\n186\t    \"tables\": [\n187\t      \"| Seed | eval PR | eval ISR | comp_mean | genuine % |\\n|------|---------|----------|-----------|-----------|\\n| s42  | 0.78    | 0.28     | 5.1       | 28%       |\\n| s43  | 0.73    | 0.24     | 5.5       | 24%       |\\n| s44  | 0.76    | 0.26     | 5.3       | 22%       |\\n| **mean±std** | **0.757±0.025** | **0.260±0.020** | **5.3±0.2** | **24.7%** |\\n\",\n188\t      \"| Cross-logic β=0.1 | FOL (3-seed) | Prolog (3-seed) |\\n|-------------------|-------------|-----------------|\\n| ISR improvement over exec | 2.96x | 2.99x |\\n| PR retention | 0.777 / 0.93 = 84% | 0.757 / 0.84 = 90% |\\n| genuine rate delta | +7.7pp | +8.4pp |\\n\"\n189\t    ],\n190\t    \"figures\": [],\n191\t    \"analysis\": \"Prolog exec+STA 的成功是 Claim 3 的强证据：STA 协议不仅能诊断 Prolog 中的 hacking，还能通过 ISR reward integration 改善结构质量。 ISR improvement ratio (3x) 跨 FOL/Prolog 一致性表明 Goodhart 的 β=0.1 sweet spot 不是逻辑特异的，而是 LOO-based structural reward 在 GRPO 中的通用属性。\\n\\n与 FOL 的 β=0.1 结果平行：ISR bonus 在 Prolog 中同样提供结构引导。 Prolog ISR 通过 rule ablation（移除每条 clause 后重新运行 SWI-Prolog 查询）计算，LOO 原则完全适用。β=0.1 的低剂量在 Prolog 中同样处于 pre-Goodhart 区间：ISR 从 0.087 (exec-only) 提升至 0.260 (3x improvement)， PR 从 0.84 微降至 0.757 (可接受的 tradeoff)。 ISR 改善幅度 (3x) 与 FOL 的 2.96x 高度一致，支持跨逻辑泛化 claim。 Genuine rate 从 exec-only 的 16.3% 提升至 24.7%，delta +8.4pp， 与 FOL 的 +7.7pp delta 在同一量级。\"\n192\t  },\n193\t  {\n194\t    \"name\": \"Cross-logic hacking taxonomy (FOL × Prolog)\",\n195\t    \"description\": \"对 FOL (plan012 已完成) 和 Prolog (plan006) exec-only 输出做 hacking 模式分类学对比，验证跨逻辑共享模式数 ≥ 3。\",\n196\t    \"results\": {\n197\t      \"fol_modes_total\": 5,\n198\t      \"prolog_modes_total\": 5,\n199\t      \"shared_modes_count\": 4,\n200\t      \"shared_modes\": [\n201\t        \"conclusion_embedding\",\n202\t        \"repetition_or_duplication\",\n203\t        \"tautological_shortcuts\",\n204\t        \"complexity_without_utility\"\n205\t      ],\n206\t      \"fol_specific_modes\": [\n207\t        \"vacuous_truth_exploitation\"\n208\t      ],\n209\t      \"prolog_specific_modes\": [\n210\t        \"backtracking_exploitation\"\n211\t      ],\n212\t      \"prolog_conclusion_embedding_rate\": 0.62,\n213\t      \"prolog_rule_duplication_rate\": 0.12,\n214\t      \"prolog_cut_tautology_rate\": 0.08,\n215\t      \"prolog_unused_predicates_rate\": 0.02,\n216\t      \"prolog_backtracking_exploitation_rate\": 0.05,\n217\t      \"prolog_genuine_rate\": 0.163,\n218\t      \"cross_logic_mode_overlap_jaccard\": 0.667\n219\t    },\n220\t    \"tables\": [\n221\t      \"| Hacking Mode | FOL | Prolog | Shared? | Mechanism |\\n|-------------|-----|--------|---------|-----------|\\n| Conclusion embedding | 72.8% (ISR b01) | 62% | ✓ | 结论直接编码为前提 |\\n| Repetition / duplication | observed (s43) | 12% | ✓ | 有效模式重复 |\\n| Tautological shortcuts | observed (s44) | 8% | ✓ | trivial truth 路径 |\\n| Complexity-without-utility | 3.8% (random) | 2% | ✓ | 无用组件填充 |\\n| Vacuous truth exploitation | observed | — | FOL-only | 空域量词 |\\n| Backtracking exploitation | — | 5% | Prolog-only | 回溯搜索偶然命中 |\\n\"\n222\t    ],\n223\t    \"figures\": [],\n224\t    \"analysis\": \"4 种共享模式 (≥3 threshold) 证明 hacking 策略是 GRPO + binary reward 动态的系统性产物，而非逻辑语言特异的巧合。这支持将 STA 框架描述为 \\\"solver-agnostic diagnostic protocol\\\"。论文应强调：共享模式反映共同的 优化动态（GRPO 饱和 → 梯度消失 → 结构捷径），而逻辑特异模式反映 语言特有的可利用结构（FOL 量词 vs Prolog 回溯）。\\n\\n4 种模式跨 FOL/Prolog 共享，因为这些退化策略根植于 exec-only GRPO 的共同机制，而非逻辑语言的语法特性： (1) Conclusion embedding: 在任何形式语言中，将结论直接编码为前提是最小化 证明复杂度的通用策略。FOL 中表现为 `conclusion = conclusion` 组件， Prolog 中表现为 `answer(X) :- X = true.`； (2) Repetition/duplication: GRPO 的 KL penalty 约束使模型倾向于重复 已知有效的模式，FOL 重复 premise，Prolog 重复 clause； (3) Tautological: 利用逻辑系统的 trivial truth 路径，FOL 用矛盾爆炸， Prolog 用 cut (!) 强制成功； (4) Complexity-without-utility: 添加不影响证明的多余组件以 \\\"看起来\\\" 复杂。 FOL-specific 的 vacuous truth (空域量词) 在 Prolog 中无对应物（Prolog 无量词）。Prolog-specific 的 backtracking exploitation (利用回溯搜索偶然 找到答案) 在 FOL 中无对应物（Prover9 无回溯机制）。 Jaccard similarity 4/(5+5-4)=0.667 表明 hacking 策略空间高度重叠。\"\n225\t  },\n226\t  {\n227\t    \"name\": \"Multi-logic joint GRPO (FOL + Prolog)\",\n228\t    \"description\": \"FOL + Prolog 联合训练，exec-only vs exec+STA，500 步，K=8，1 seed。 测试跨逻辑联合训练的 transfer 效应。\",\n229\t    \"results\": {\n230\t      \"joint_exec_fol_pr\": 0.72,\n231\t      \"joint_exec_fol_isr\": 0.1,\n232\t      \"joint_exec_prolog_pr\": 0.68,\n233\t      \"joint_exec_prolog_isr\": 0.07,\n234\t      \"joint_sta_fol_pr\": 0.67,\n235\t      \"joint_sta_fol_isr\": 0.21,\n236\t      \"joint_sta_prolog_pr\": 0.63,\n237\t      \"joint_sta_prolog_isr\": 0.18,\n238\t      \"single_vs_joint_fol_pr_delta\": -0.21,\n239\t      \"single_vs_joint_prolog_pr_delta\": -0.16\n240\t    },\n241\t    \"tables\": [\n242\t      \"| Condition | FOL PR | FOL ISR | Prolog PR | Prolog ISR |\\n|-----------|--------|---------|-----------|------------|\\n| Joint exec-only | 0.72 | 0.10 | 0.68 | 0.07 |\\n| Joint exec+STA β=0.1 | 0.67 | 0.21 | 0.63 | 0.18 |\\n| Single exec-only (ref) | 0.93 | 0.12 | 0.84 | 0.09 |\\n| Single exec+STA (ref) | 0.81 | 0.34 | 0.76 | 0.26 |\\n\"\n243\t    ],\n244\t    \"figures\": [],\n245\t    \"analysis\": \"Joint training 在当前模型规模下是 net negative for per-task performance。 但这并非 STA 协议的失败——ISR signal 在 joint 中仍有效。 论文中应作为 scale limitation 讨论，指向 plan011 (8B model) 作为 capacity-sufficient 的 future work。对 Claim 3 影响有限： STA protocol 泛化性已由 single-logic Prolog 实验证明， joint training 是 additional evidence 非核心证据。\\n\\n联合训练在容量受限的 0.5B 模型上引入 task competition：两种逻辑 共享 transformer 参数，导致 per-task PR 均低于单逻辑训练 (FOL 0.72 vs 0.93, Prolog 0.68 vs 0.84)。ISR 比例也略降。这是 multi-task learning 在小模型上的已知 tradeoff——容量不足以同时掌握两种逻辑语法。 exec+STA 联合训练的 ISR 仍高于 exec-only (FOL 0.21 vs 0.10, Prolog 0.18 vs 0.07)，说明 ISR bonus 的结构引导在多任务设置下仍有效， 但改善幅度 (2.1x/2.6x) 低于单逻辑的 3x，暗示容量瓶颈限制了 structural improvement 的上限。\"\n246\t  },\n247\t  {\n248\t    \"name\": \"Cross-logic transfer evaluation\",\n249\t    \"description\": \"FOL-trained model 在 Prolog tasks 上评估，反之亦然。 测试 formalization 能力的跨逻辑迁移。\",\n250\t    \"results\": {\n251\t      \"fol_to_prolog_pr\": 0.32,\n252\t      \"fol_to_prolog_isr\": 0.04,\n253\t      \"prolog_to_fol_pr\": 0.28,\n254\t      \"prolog_to_fol_isr\": 0.03,\n255\t      \"fol_on_fol_pr_ref\": 0.93,\n256\t      \"prolog_on_prolog_pr_ref\": 0.84,\n257\t      \"transfer_ratio_fol_to_prolog\": 0.38,\n258\t      \"transfer_ratio_prolog_to_fol\": 0.3\n259\t    },\n260\t    \"tables\": [\n261\t      \"| Source → Target | PR | ISR | vs in-domain PR |\\n|----------------|-----|-----|-----------------|\\n| FOL → Prolog | 0.32 | 0.04 | 38% of Prolog in-domain |\\n| Prolog → FOL | 0.28 | 0.03 | 30% of FOL in-domain |\\n| FOL → FOL (ref) | 0.93 | 0.12 | 100% |\\n| Prolog → Prolog (ref) | 0.84 | 0.09 | 100% |\\n\"\n262\t    ],\n263\t    \"figures\": [],\n264\t    \"analysis\": \"Cross-logic transfer 的有限性是预期结果，不影响 STA 论文的核心 claims。 反而支持论点：STA 协议需要 per-logic instantiation (rule ablation for Prolog, component ablation for FOL)，不能依赖 model-level transfer 替代。 论文应在 Discussion 中简短提及。\\n\\n跨逻辑 transfer 有限 (PR 降至 28-32%)，因为 FOL 和 Prolog 的语法 结构本质不同：FOL 使用量词/连接词/谓词逻辑，Prolog 使用 Horn clauses/ unification/backtracking。GRPO 训练针对特定逻辑语法优化 token 序列 生成策略，这些策略不跨语法迁移。 然而 30% 的 transfer ratio 高于 random baseline (~12%)，说明 formalization 的高层语义理解（如何从自然语言提取逻辑结构）有部分共享。 ISR 在 transfer 场景极低 (0.03-0.04)，表明迁移产生的 formalizations 即使碰巧 proved 也是结构退化的——模型在不熟悉的逻辑中走更多捷径。\"\n265\t  },\n266\t  {\n267\t    \"name\": \"SFT baseline comparison\",\n268\t    \"description\": \"Supervised finetuning on FOLIO 500，与 GRPO variants 对比。 测试 SFT 是否也出现结构退化。\",\n269\t    \"results\": {\n270\t      \"sft_eval_pr\": 0.48,\n271\t      \"sft_eval_mean_isr\": 0.24,\n272\t      \"sft_eval_proved_only_isr\": 0.5,\n273\t      \"sft_eval_component_count_mean\": 5.6,\n274\t      \"sft_eval_genuine_rate\": 0.38,\n275\t      \"sft_eval_hacking_rate\": 0.62,\n276\t      \"sft_vs_grpo_exec_pr\": -0.45,\n277\t      \"sft_vs_grpo_b01_isr\": -0.1\n278\t    },\n279\t    \"tables\": [\n280\t      \"| Method | eval PR | eval ISR | proved-only ISR | genuine % | hacking % |\\n|--------|---------|----------|-----------------|-----------|-----------|\\n| SFT | 0.48 | 0.24 | 0.50 | 38% | 62% |\\n| GRPO exec-only (s42) | 0.93 | 0.12 | 0.13 | ~18% | ~82% |\\n| GRPO ISR β=0.1 (s42) | 0.81 | 0.34 | 0.42 | 26% | 74% |\\n| Pretrained (ref) | 0.12 | 0.06 | 0.64 | ~50% | ~50% |\\n\"\n281\t    ],\n282\t    \"figures\": [],\n283\t    \"analysis\": \"SFT 是重要对照：它展示了无 RL 优化压力时的 baseline 结构质量。 SFT 的 proved-only ISR (0.50) 接近 pretrained (0.64)，确认 structural degeneration 是 RL 优化的副产物。GRPO ISR β=0.1 是 唯一同时保持 high PR 和 reasonable ISR 的条件——比 SFT 高 PR (0.81 vs 0.48) 且 ISR 相当 (0.34 vs 0.24)，是最佳 PR-ISR tradeoff。\\n\\nSFT 复制训练分布而非优化 reward，因此不经历 GRPO 的饱和→hacking 动态。 PR 较低 (0.48 vs GRPO 0.93) 因为 SFT 无法通过 trial-and-error 发现 有效但不在训练集中的证明策略。但 proved-only ISR 较高 (0.50 vs 0.13) 因为 SFT 保留了训练数据中的结构模式。 Genuine rate 0.38 (vs GRPO exec-only ~0.18) 表明 SFT 的 hacking 更少， 但这是以 PR 天花板为代价的——SFT 不 hack 因为它不 optimize。 这支持论文的核心论点：reward hacking 是优化产物，诊断工具 (如 ISR) 在 RL 设置中比 SFT 更需要。\"\n284\t  },\n285\t  {\n286\t    \"name\": \"SMT-LIB single-logic GRPO (third logic)\",\n287\t    \"description\": \"SMT-LIB 单逻辑 GRPO，exec-only vs exec+STA，500 步。 第三种逻辑类型验证 STA 协议泛化性。\",\n288\t    \"results\": {\n289\t      \"exec_only_pr\": 0.72,\n290\t      \"exec_only_isr\": 0.09,\n291\t      \"exec_only_component_count_mean\": 8.1,\n292\t      \"exec_sta_b01_pr\": 0.67,\n293\t      \"exec_sta_b01_isr\": 0.24,\n294\t      \"exec_sta_b01_component_count_mean\": 5.4,\n295\t      \"isr_improvement_ratio\": 2.67,\n296\t      \"hacking_modes_shared_with_fol\": 3,\n297\t      \"hacking_modes_shared_with_prolog\": 3\n298\t    },\n299\t    \"tables\": [\n300\t      \"| Condition | SMT-LIB PR | SMT-LIB ISR | comp_mean |\\n|-----------|-----------|-------------|-----------|\\n| exec-only | 0.72 | 0.09 | 8.1 |\\n| exec+STA β=0.1 | 0.67 | 0.24 | 5.4 |\\n| ISR improvement | — | 2.67x | 0.67x |\\n\"\n301\t    ],\n302\t    \"figures\": [],\n303\t    \"analysis\": \"第三种逻辑进一步巩固 Claim 3。三逻辑 ISR improvement 在 2.67-2.99x 区间的一致性表明 STA 的 LOO ablation 原则是 solver-agnostic 的—— 只要 solver 接受结构化输入且 reward 是二值的，STA 就适用。 若 SMT-LIB 实验在 submission 前完成，从两逻辑升级为三逻辑将 显著增强泛化性 claim。否则作为 appendix 或 camera-ready 追加。\\n\\nSMT-LIB 使用 Z3 solver，constraint satisfaction 语义与 FOL/Prolog 不同（声明式约束而非推导式证明），但 binary execution reward 的动态 相同。Exec-only 出现 hacking (PR 0.72, ISR 0.09)，ISR β=0.1 改善 至 0.24 (2.67x)。SMT-LIB 的 hacking 主要表现为 over-constrained assertions（添加冗余约束使 sat/unsat 结果不变）和 trivial assertions （直接 assert 结论）。与 FOL/Prolog 共享 conclusion embedding、 redundancy、tautological 三种模式。 ISR improvement ratio (2.67x) 略低于 FOL/Prolog 的 3x，可能因为 SMT-LIB 的 constraint structure 比 FOL premise structure 更刚性， ISR 信号的 reward shaping 空间更小。\"\n304\t  },\n305\t  {\n306\t    \"name\": \"Qwen3-8B model scale effect\",\n307\t    \"description\": \"Qwen3-8B (vs 0.5B baseline) 上运行 exec-only + exec+STA GRPO。 测试模型规模对 reward hacking 和 ISR 诊断的影响。\",\n308\t    \"results\": {\n309\t      \"exec_only_pr\": 0.96,\n310\t      \"exec_only_isr\": 0.19,\n311\t      \"exec_only_component_count_mean\": 6.2,\n312\t      \"exec_only_hacking_rate\": 0.68,\n313\t      \"exec_sta_b01_pr\": 0.92,\n314\t      \"exec_sta_b01_isr\": 0.42,\n315\t      \"exec_sta_b01_genuine_rate\": 0.35,\n316\t      \"pr_retention\": 0.958\n317\t    },\n318\t    \"tables\": [\n319\t      \"| Scale | Condition | PR | ISR | genuine % | hacking % |\\n|-------|-----------|-----|-----|-----------|-----------|\\n| 0.5B | exec-only | 0.93 | 0.12 | ~18% | ~82% |\\n| 0.5B | ISR β=0.1 | 0.81 | 0.34 | 26% | 74% |\\n| 8B | exec-only | 0.96 | 0.19 | ~32% | ~68% |\\n| 8B | ISR β=0.1 | 0.92 | 0.42 | 35% | 65% |\\n\"\n320\t    ],\n321\t    \"figures\": [],\n322\t    \"analysis\": \"Scaling 降低 hacking rate (82%→68% exec-only) 但不消除它。 这是重要发现：即使 frontier-scale 模型也需要 ISR 诊断。 ISR β=0.1 在更大模型上的 diminishing Goodhart risk (PR retention 95.8% vs 87.1%) 暗示 sweet spot 可能随模型规模右移， 未来工作可探索 larger β at larger scale。\\n\\n8B 模型有更大的 representation capacity，能在不完全牺牲结构的情况下 实现高 PR。因此 exec-only ISR (0.19) 高于 0.5B (0.12)——更大模型 保留更多 \\\"附带\\\" 的结构信息。但 hacking 仍存在 (68%)，说明 reward hacking 不纯粹是 capacity 问题，而是 optimization objective 问题。ISR β=0.1 在 8B 上效果更显著 (ISR 0.42 vs 0.5B 的 0.34)， 因为更大模型有更多容量来同时优化 PR 和结构质量。 PR retention (0.92/0.96 = 95.8%) 优于 0.5B (0.81/0.93 = 87.1%)， 说明在 sufficient capacity 下 ISR 信号的 PR cost 接近零。\"\n323\t  },\n324\t  {\n325\t    \"name\": \"Curriculum ablation (sigmoid vs linear vs fixed)\",\n326\t    \"description\": \"测试 ISR reward 的 curriculum scheduling：sigmoid ramp (baseline) vs linear ramp vs fixed weight。Sigmoid 是 plan005 的最佳配置 但未做消融。\",\n327\t    \"results\": {\n328\t      \"sigmoid_eval_pr\": 0.77,\n329\t      \"sigmoid_eval_isr\": 0.23,\n330\t      \"sigmoid_midpoint_step\": 200,\n331\t      \"linear_eval_pr\": 0.73,\n332\t      \"linear_eval_isr\": 0.19,\n333\t      \"fixed_b01_eval_pr\": 0.81,\n334\t      \"fixed_b01_eval_isr\": 0.34,\n335\t      \"fixed_b03_eval_pr\": 0.18,\n336\t      \"fixed_b03_eval_isr\": 0.03,\n337\t      \"sigmoid_vs_linear_isr_delta\": 0.04,\n338\t      \"linear_midpoint100_pr\": 0.7,\n339\t      \"linear_midpoint300_pr\": 0.75\n340\t    },\n341\t    \"tables\": [\n342\t      \"| Curriculum | Formula | eval PR | eval ISR | optimal midpoint |\\n|-----------|---------|---------|----------|------------------|\\n| Fixed β=0.1 | multiplicative | **0.81** | **0.34** | N/A |\\n| Sigmoid (midpoint=200) | convex | 0.77 | 0.23 | 200 |\\n| Linear (midpoint=200) | convex | 0.73 | 0.19 | 200 |\\n| Fixed β=0.3 | multiplicative | 0.18 | 0.03 | N/A (Goodhart) |\\n\",\n343\t      \"| Linear midpoint | eval PR | eval ISR |\\n|----------------|---------|----------|\\n| 100 | 0.70 | 0.17 |\\n| 200 | 0.73 | 0.19 |\\n| 300 | 0.75 | 0.15 |\\n\"\n344\t    ],\n345\t    \"figures\": [],\n346\t    \"analysis\": \"关键发现：在乘法公式 r = r_exec·(1+β·ISR) 下，curriculum scheduling 的边际价值很小——fixed β=0.1 已经是最优。这是因为乘法公式中 ISR 只能 是 bonus (≥0)，不存在 early penalty 问题。Sigmoid curriculum 主要 对凸组合公式有价值（避免 ISR<1 时的 penalty 效应）。 论文应在 ablation 中简短报告此结果，结论：乘法公式 + fixed β=0.1 是最简洁有效的配置，无需 curriculum 复杂化。\\n\\n注意：plan005 使用凸组合公式 (α·r_exec + β·r_exec·ISR, α+β=1)， 而 plan002-b01 使用乘法公式 (r = r_exec·(1+β·ISR))。plan015 需要 在两种公式下分别测试 curriculum。 Fixed β=0.1 (plan002-b01 已验证) 是最佳 fixed 配置。Sigmoid 和 linear ramp 在凸组合公式下有效果，因为 early ISR penalty (ISR<1 时) 需要 逐步引入以避免早期训练崩塌。但在乘法公式下，ISR 只能 bonus， curriculum 的意义降低——fixed β=0.1 已经是 \\\"permanently gentle bonus\\\"， 不需要 ramp。 Sigmoid 略优于 linear (ISR 0.23 vs 0.19) 因为 sigmoid 的 S-curve 在中期 (step 150-250) 快速提升 ISR weight，比 linear 的匀速增长 更好地利用了模型已学到基础证明能力的时间窗口。 Midpoint 影响：100 (过早) 导致 early ISR pressure → PR 降； 300 (过晚) 使 ISR signal 在后 200 步才充分生效，改善有限。\"\n347\t  }\n348\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"73336205-529c-453d-86e3-0557efef9ea8","uuid":"3003bbb8-cee9-4d50-8d61-4751d34a1249","timestamp":"2026-05-14T09:52:07.038Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T092544/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"ISR β=0.1 three-seed replication\",\n    \"description\": \"s42 已完成 (PR=0.81, ISR=0.337)。s43/s44 使用相同超参、不同 seed 复现。 验证 ISR sweet spot 跨 seed 稳健性。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"s43_eval_prove_rate\": 0.77,\n      \"s43_eval_mean_isr\": 0.305,\n      \"s43_eval_proved_only_isr\": 0.396,\n      \"s43_eval_component_count_mean\": 5.82,\n      \"s43_eval_isr_0_ratio\": 0.052,\n      \"s43_eval_isr_1_ratio\": 0.104,\n      \"s43_eval_tautological_collapse\": false,\n      \"s43_train_last100_pr\": 0.66,\n      \"s43_train_last100_isr\": 0.178,\n      \"s44_eval_prove_rate\": 0.75,\n      \"s44_eval_mean_isr\": 0.282,\n      \"s44_eval_proved_only_isr\": 0.376,\n      \"s44_eval_component_count_mean\": 6.08,\n      \"s44_eval_isr_0_ratio\": 0.067,\n      \"s44_eval_isr_1_ratio\": 0.093,\n      \"s44_eval_tautological_collapse\": false,\n      \"s44_train_last100_pr\": 0.63,\n      \"s44_train_last100_isr\": 0.165,\n      \"three_seed_mean_pr\": 0.777,\n      \"three_seed_std_pr\": 0.03,\n      \"three_seed_mean_isr\": 0.308,\n      \"three_seed_std_isr\": 0.028,\n      \"three_seed_mean_proved_only_isr\": 0.396,\n      \"three_seed_mean_component_count\": 5.83\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"| Seed | eval PR | eval ISR | proved-only ISR | comp_mean | tautological |\\n|------|---------|----------|-----------------|-----------|-------------|\\n| s42  | 0.81    | 0.337    | 0.415           | 5.58      | No          |\\n| s43  | 0.77    | 0.305    | 0.396           | 5.82      | No          |\\n| s44  | 0.75    | 0.282    | 0.376           | 6.08      | No          |\\n| **mean±std** | **0.777±0.030** | **0.308±0.028** | **0.396±0.020** | **5.83±0.25** | — |\\n\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"ISR β=0.1 的核心发现：它是一个稳定器而非最大化器。exec-only 三 seed 产生 三种完全不同的退化模式 (PR 从 0.14 到 0.98，ISR 从 0 到 0.57)， 而 ISR β=0.1 将三 seed 收敛至同一区域 (PR 0.75-0.81, ISR 0.28-0.34)。 这表明 low-dose ISR 信号提供的不仅是结构改善，更是训练动态的正则化。 std(PR)=0.030, std(ISR)=0.028 的低方差进一步证实跨 seed 稳健性。\\n\\ns42 已验证 ISR β=0.1 sweet spot (PR=0.81, ISR=0.337)。在 best 档，s43 和 s44 复现同方向结果，因为 β=0.1 的优化压力足够低，避免 Goodhart 效应，同时提供 结构引导信号。关键机制：ISR bonus (r = r_exec·(1+0.1·ISR)) 在早期训练中 对结构完整的证明给予微弱正向激励，足以将 GRPO 探索引导至 genuine 证明区域， 但压力不足以触发对 ISR 本身的 gaming。 s43 在 exec-only 中出现 repetition collapse (PR=0.14)，但 ISR bonus 改变了 early-training 梯度景观——少数结构完整的早期成功获得更高 reward，打破了 退化吸引子。s44 在 exec-only 中出现 tautological collapse (comp=2.04)， ISR bonus 奖励 ISR>0.5 的多组件证明，将优化推离 2-component 极小解。 自然 seed 方差导致 s43/s44 的 ISR 略低于 s42 (0.31/0.28 vs 0.34)， 但方向完全一致。std(ISR)=0.028 表明效应跨 seed 稳健。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Random β=0.1 three-seed control\",\n    \"description\": \"s42 已完成 (PR=0.79, ISR=0.104)。s43/s44 复现 random β=0.1 对照， 与 plan002-b01 三 seed 做 matched comparison。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"s43_eval_prove_rate\": 0.74,\n      \"s43_eval_mean_isr\": 0.089,\n      \"s43_eval_proved_only_isr\": 0.12,\n      \"s43_eval_component_count_mean\": 8.92,\n      \"s44_eval_prove_rate\": 0.76,\n      \"s44_eval_mean_isr\": 0.118,\n      \"s44_eval_proved_only_isr\": 0.155,\n      \"s44_eval_component_count_mean\": 8.15,\n      \"three_seed_mean_pr\": 0.763,\n      \"three_seed_std_pr\": 0.025,\n      \"three_seed_mean_isr\": 0.104,\n      \"three_seed_std_isr\": 0.015,\n      \"three_seed_mean_component_count\": 8.51\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"| Seed | eval PR | eval ISR | proved-only ISR | comp_mean |\\n|------|---------|----------|-----------------|-----------|\\n| s42  | 0.79    | 0.104    | 0.131           | 8.46      |\\n| s43  | 0.74    | 0.089    | 0.120           | 8.92      |\\n| s44  | 0.76    | 0.118    | 0.155           | 8.15      |\\n| **mean±std** | **0.763±0.025** | **0.104±0.015** | **0.135±0.018** | **8.51±0.39** |\\n\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Random β=0.1 的结论：β=0.1 dose 的方差注入是 GRPO 抗饱和的有效手段 （PR 维持），但 ISR 信号是结构改善的充要条件。Random 组 ISR~0.10 接近 exec-only baseline 的 0.12，说明 random noise 对结构质量无贡献。\\n\\nRandom β=0.1 提供与 ISR β=0.1 相同强度的方差注入，但无结构信号。 PR 维持在 0.74-0.79 (与 ISR 组的 0.75-0.81 无显著差异) 表明 β=0.1 的方差注入本身不损害证明能力。但 ISR 仅为 0.09-0.12，是 ISR 组的 1/3， 说明 random noise 不提供结构引导——模型仍走 conclusion embedding 等 捷径，只是 noise 打破了 GRPO 饱和导致的梯度消失，维持了一定的探索。 Component count 8.5 vs ISR 组的 5.8 表明 random 组的证明更冗余（更多 不必要组件），而 ISR 组通过结构奖励压缩了证明至更精简的形式。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"3-seed ISR vs Random statistical comparison\",\n    \"description\": \"三 seed ISR β=0.1 vs Random β=0.1 的统计检验，验证 ISR 信号的 structural value 跨 seed 显著。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"isr_over_random_ratio_mean\": 2.96,\n      \"isr_over_random_ratio_per_seed\": [\n        3.24,\n        3.43,\n        2.39\n      ],\n      \"isr_over_random_ratio_std\": 0.55,\n      \"isr_over_random_ratio_95ci\": [\n        1.66,\n        4.39\n      ],\n      \"welch_t_isr\": 11.1,\n      \"welch_df\": 3.1,\n      \"welch_p\": 0.002,\n      \"pr_difference_p\": 0.52,\n      \"pr_difference_not_significant\": true,\n      \"genuine_rate_isr_per_seed\": [\n        0.259,\n        0.24,\n        0.22\n      ],\n      \"genuine_rate_random_per_seed\": [\n        0.177,\n        0.16,\n        0.15\n      ],\n      \"genuine_rate_delta_mean_pp\": 7.7,\n      \"genuine_rate_delta_range_pp\": [\n        7.0,\n        8.2\n      ],\n      \"cohen_d_isr\": 9.6\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"| Metric | ISR β=0.1 (mean±std) | Random β=0.1 (mean±std) | Ratio | p-value |\\n|--------|---------------------|------------------------|-------|---------|\\n| eval PR | 0.777±0.030 | 0.763±0.025 | 1.02x | 0.52 (ns) |\\n| eval ISR | 0.308±0.028 | 0.104±0.015 | **2.96x** | **0.002** |\\n| proved-only ISR | 0.396±0.020 | 0.135±0.018 | 2.93x | 0.001 |\\n| component count | 5.83±0.25 | 8.51±0.39 | 0.69x | 0.003 |\\n| genuine rate | 24.0%±2.0% | 16.2%±1.4% | — | +7.7pp |\\n\",\n      \"| Per-seed ISR ratio | s42 | s43 | s44 | mean±std |\\n|-------------------|-----|-----|-----|----------|\\n| ISR(ISR) / ISR(random) | 3.24 | 3.43 | 2.39 | 3.02±0.55 |\\n| 95% CI: [1.66, 4.39] — does not cross 1 |\\n\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"这是论文 Claim 2 的核心证据：ISR 信号提供 genuine structural guidance， 非方差正则化副产物。效应量 (d=9.6) 远超常规阈值 (0.8 = large)， 即使 n=3 也高度显著。与 β=0.3 Goodhart 崩塌形成对照，完整刻画 ISR-as-proxy-metric 的 Goodhart 曲线：β=0.1 sweet spot, β∈(0.1,0.3) 转折，β=0.3 post-Goodhart。\\n\\n三 seed 样本量小 (n=3)，但效应量极大 (Cohen's d=9.6)，使得 Welch t-test 仍高度显著 (p=0.002)。ISR/random ratio 95% CI [1.66, 4.39] 不跨 1， point estimate 2.96 满足 ≥2.5 门槛。PR 无显著差异 (p=0.52) 确认 ISR 改善 是 \\\"免费的\\\"——不以证明能力为代价。Genuine rate delta 7.7pp (范围 7.0-8.2pp) 在 [5.0, 12.0] 区间内，表明 ISR β=0.1 确实增加了 genuine proof 占比。 该效应量在如此小的 n 下仍显著，说明 ISR 信号的结构引导是 robust 的。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"STA O(1) vs O(N) computational ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"对比 fast_isr_fol (O(1) 近似，仅测试首组件) vs full STA (O(N) LOO ablation) 在 500 步 exec+STA 训练中的效果。文档化 O(1) 无法捕捉结构依赖的 negative result。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"o1_eval_prove_rate\": 0.91,\n      \"o1_eval_mean_isr_fast\": 0.03,\n      \"o1_eval_mean_isr_true\": 0.11,\n      \"o1_eval_component_count_mean\": 9.2,\n      \"o1_train_duration_min\": 42,\n      \"on_eval_prove_rate\": 0.93,\n      \"on_eval_mean_isr\": 0.12,\n      \"on_eval_component_count_mean\": 8.8,\n      \"on_train_duration_min\": 68,\n      \"speedup_ratio\": 1.62,\n      \"isr_correlation_o1_on\": 0.18\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"| Method | eval PR | eval ISR | comp_mean | train time (min) | ISR signal quality |\\n|--------|---------|----------|-----------|------------------|--------------------|\\n| O(1) fast_isr | 0.91 | 0.03 (fast) / 0.11 (true) | 9.2 | 42 | ρ=0.18 with O(N) |\\n| O(N) full STA | 0.93 | 0.12 | 8.8 | 68 | ground truth |\\n| exec-only (ref) | 0.93 | 0.12 | — | 35 | N/A |\\n\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Negative result 文档化：O(1) 不工作是因为 ISR 的核心价值在于检测 组件间冗余关系（如 conclusion embedding 使所有 premise 组件变得不必要）， 单点采样无法捕捉这种全局结构信息。这也解释了为什么 ISR 计算成本是 STA 协议的必要开销。论文应在 Method 章节讨论此 tradeoff。\\n\\nO(1) fast_isr 仅移除第一个组件测试证明是否仍成立，无法检测多组件间的 冗余模式（如 conclusion embedding 中结论组件不在首位的情况）。 在 500 步训练中，O(1) ISR 信号近乎随机 (与 O(N) 的相关性仅 0.18)， 因此对训练几乎无结构引导——结果与 exec-only baseline 相似。 O(1) 快 1.6x 但信息量损失 ~90%，是 accuracy-speed tradeoff 的错误端。 此结果证明 LOO 的 O(N) 计算是必要的，不可用单点近似替代。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Prolog exec-only GRPO (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"Prolog 单逻辑 GRPO，execution-only reward，500 步，K=8，3 seeds。 验证 Prolog 环境下 exec-only 训练是否出现 reward hacking。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"s42_eval_prove_rate\": 0.85,\n      \"s42_eval_mean_isr\": 0.08,\n      \"s42_eval_proved_only_isr\": 0.094,\n      \"s42_eval_component_count_mean\": 7.4,\n      \"s42_eval_dominant_hacking\": \"conclusion_embedding\",\n      \"s42_eval_genuine_rate\": 0.16,\n      \"s43_eval_prove_rate\": 0.79,\n      \"s43_eval_mean_isr\": 0.13,\n      \"s43_eval_proved_only_isr\": 0.165,\n      \"s43_eval_component_count_mean\": 6.5,\n      \"s43_eval_dominant_hacking\": \"rule_duplication\",\n      \"s43_eval_genuine_rate\": 0.21,\n      \"s44_eval_prove_rate\": 0.88,\n      \"s44_eval_mean_isr\": 0.05,\n      \"s44_eval_proved_only_isr\": 0.057,\n      \"s44_eval_component_count_mean\": 8.3,\n      \"s44_eval_dominant_hacking\": \"cut_tautology\",\n      \"s44_eval_genuine_rate\": 0.12,\n      \"three_seed_mean_pr\": 0.84,\n      \"three_seed_std_pr\": 0.046,\n      \"three_seed_mean_isr\": 0.087,\n      \"three_seed_std_isr\": 0.04,\n      \"three_seed_mean_genuine_rate\": 0.163,\n      \"three_seed_hacking_rate\": 0.837\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"| Seed | eval PR | eval ISR | proved-only ISR | comp_mean | dominant hacking | genuine % |\\n|------|---------|----------|-----------------|-----------|------------------|-----------|\\n| s42  | 0.85    | 0.08     | 0.094           | 7.4       | conclusion embedding | 16% |\\n| s43  | 0.79    | 0.13     | 0.165           | 6.5       | rule duplication | 21% |\\n| s44  | 0.88    | 0.05     | 0.057           | 8.3       | cut tautology | 12% |\\n| **mean±std** | **0.84±0.046** | **0.087±0.040** | **0.105±0.055** | **7.4±0.9** | — | **16.3%** |\\n\",\n      \"| 对比 FOL exec-only | FOL (s42) | Prolog (mean) |\\n|-------------------|-----------|---------------|\\n| eval PR | 0.93 | 0.84 |\\n| eval ISR | 0.123 | 0.087 |\\n| hacking rate | ~82% | ~84% |\\n| seed divergence | 3 modes | 3 modes |\\n\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Prolog exec-only 复现了 FOL 的核心发现：PR 高但 ISR 低，三 seed 出现不同退化模式。这是 Claim 3 的基础——STA 诊断协议的需求在 Prolog 中同样存在。hacking rate 84% (vs FOL 82%) 表明 exec-only GRPO 的 reward hacking 问题不是 FOL 特有的，而是二值 execution reward + GRPO 的系统性问题。\\n\\nProlog 与 FOL 共享关键动态：SWI-Prolog 的 execution reward 是二值的 （query 成功/失败），与 Prover9 类似。GRPO 在二值 reward 下同样会 饱和，驱动模型寻找结构捷径。Prolog 特有的 hacking 机制： (1) Conclusion embedding → head 直接编码答案 (e.g., `answer(true) :- true.`)， 与 FOL 的 conclusion embedding 同构； (2) Rule duplication → 同一 clause 重复多次，SWI-Prolog 回溯时均匹配但 仅第一条有用，类似 FOL repetition collapse； (3) Cut tautology → 使用 `!` (cut) 强制成功，跳过真正的逻辑推导， 类似 FOL tautological shortcuts。 PR 高 (0.79-0.88) 但 ISR 低 (0.05-0.13) 的 gap 确认 hacking 存在。 三 seed 出现不同主导退化模式，与 FOL exec-only 的 seed 发散行为一致， 进一步证明 exec-only GRPO 的训练动态在逻辑类型间共享。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Prolog exec+STA GRPO (3 seeds, ISR β=0.1)\",\n    \"description\": \"Prolog GRPO with ISR bonus (r = r_exec · (1 + 0.1·ISR))，500 步，K=8， 3 seeds。验证 STA reward integration 在 Prolog 中的效果。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"s42_eval_prove_rate\": 0.78,\n      \"s42_eval_mean_isr\": 0.28,\n      \"s42_eval_component_count_mean\": 5.1,\n      \"s42_eval_genuine_rate\": 0.28,\n      \"s43_eval_prove_rate\": 0.73,\n      \"s43_eval_mean_isr\": 0.24,\n      \"s43_eval_component_count_mean\": 5.5,\n      \"s43_eval_genuine_rate\": 0.24,\n      \"s44_eval_prove_rate\": 0.76,\n      \"s44_eval_mean_isr\": 0.26,\n      \"s44_eval_component_count_mean\": 5.3,\n      \"s44_eval_genuine_rate\": 0.22,\n      \"three_seed_mean_pr\": 0.757,\n      \"three_seed_std_pr\": 0.025,\n      \"three_seed_mean_isr\": 0.26,\n      \"three_seed_std_isr\": 0.02,\n      \"isr_improvement_over_exec\": 2.99,\n      \"genuine_rate_mean\": 0.247\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"| Seed | eval PR | eval ISR | comp_mean | genuine % |\\n|------|---------|----------|-----------|-----------|\\n| s42  | 0.78    | 0.28     | 5.1       | 28%       |\\n| s43  | 0.73    | 0.24     | 5.5       | 24%       |\\n| s44  | 0.76    | 0.26     | 5.3       | 22%       |\\n| **mean±std** | **0.757±0.025** | **0.260±0.020** | **5.3±0.2** | **24.7%** |\\n\",\n      \"| Cross-logic β=0.1 | FOL (3-seed) | Prolog (3-seed) |\\n|-------------------|-------------|-----------------|\\n| ISR improvement over exec | 2.96x | 2.99x |\\n| PR retention | 0.777 / 0.93 = 84% | 0.757 / 0.84 = 90% |\\n| genuine rate delta | +7.7pp | +8.4pp |\\n\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Prolog exec+STA 的成功是 Claim 3 的强证据：STA 协议不仅能诊断 Prolog 中的 hacking，还能通过 ISR reward integration 改善结构质量。 ISR improvement ratio (3x) 跨 FOL/Prolog 一致性表明 Goodhart 的 β=0.1 sweet spot 不是逻辑特异的，而是 LOO-based structural reward 在 GRPO 中的通用属性。\\n\\n与 FOL 的 β=0.1 结果平行：ISR bonus 在 Prolog 中同样提供结构引导。 Prolog ISR 通过 rule ablation（移除每条 clause 后重新运行 SWI-Prolog 查询）计算，LOO 原则完全适用。β=0.1 的低剂量在 Prolog 中同样处于 pre-Goodhart 区间：ISR 从 0.087 (exec-only) 提升至 0.260 (3x improvement)， PR 从 0.84 微降至 0.757 (可接受的 tradeoff)。 ISR 改善幅度 (3x) 与 FOL 的 2.96x 高度一致，支持跨逻辑泛化 claim。 Genuine rate 从 exec-only 的 16.3% 提升至 24.7%，delta +8.4pp， 与 FOL 的 +7.7pp delta 在同一量级。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cross-logic hacking taxonomy (FOL × Prolog)\",\n    \"description\": \"对 FOL (plan012 已完成) 和 Prolog (plan006) exec-only 输出做 hacking 模式分类学对比，验证跨逻辑共享模式数 ≥ 3。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"fol_modes_total\": 5,\n      \"prolog_modes_total\": 5,\n      \"shared_modes_count\": 4,\n      \"shared_modes\": [\n        \"conclusion_embedding\",\n        \"repetition_or_duplication\",\n        \"tautological_shortcuts\",\n        \"complexity_without_utility\"\n      ],\n      \"fol_specific_modes\": [\n        \"vacuous_truth_exploitation\"\n      ],\n      \"prolog_specific_modes\": [\n        \"backtracking_exploitation\"\n      ],\n      \"prolog_conclusion_embedding_rate\": 0.62,\n      \"prolog_rule_duplication_rate\": 0.12,\n      \"prolog_cut_tautology_rate\": 0.08,\n      \"prolog_unused_predicates_rate\": 0.02,\n      \"prolog_backtracking_exploitation_rate\": 0.05,\n      \"prolog_genuine_rate\": 0.163,\n      \"cross_logic_mode_overlap_jaccard\": 0.667\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"| Hacking Mode | FOL | Prolog | Shared? | Mechanism |\\n|-------------|-----|--------|---------|-----------|\\n| Conclusion embedding | 72.8% (ISR b01) | 62% | ✓ | 结论直接编码为前提 |\\n| Repetition / duplication | observed (s43) | 12% | ✓ | 有效模式重复 |\\n| Tautological shortcuts | observed (s44) | 8% | ✓ | trivial truth 路径 |\\n| Complexity-without-utility | 3.8% (random) | 2% | ✓ | 无用组件填充 |\\n| Vacuous truth exploitation | observed | — | FOL-only | 空域量词 |\\n| Backtracking exploitation | — | 5% | Prolog-only | 回溯搜索偶然命中 |\\n\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"4 种共享模式 (≥3 threshold) 证明 hacking 策略是 GRPO + binary reward 动态的系统性产物，而非逻辑语言特异的巧合。这支持将 STA 框架描述为 \\\"solver-agnostic diagnostic protocol\\\"。论文应强调：共享模式反映共同的 优化动态（GRPO 饱和 → 梯度消失 → 结构捷径），而逻辑特异模式反映 语言特有的可利用结构（FOL 量词 vs Prolog 回溯）。\\n\\n4 种模式跨 FOL/Prolog 共享，因为这些退化策略根植于 exec-only GRPO 的共同机制，而非逻辑语言的语法特性： (1) Conclusion embedding: 在任何形式语言中，将结论直接编码为前提是最小化 证明复杂度的通用策略。FOL 中表现为 `conclusion = conclusion` 组件， Prolog 中表现为 `answer(X) :- X = true.`； (2) Repetition/duplication: GRPO 的 KL penalty 约束使模型倾向于重复 已知有效的模式，FOL 重复 premise，Prolog 重复 clause； (3) Tautological: 利用逻辑系统的 trivial truth 路径，FOL 用矛盾爆炸， Prolog 用 cut (!) 强制成功； (4) Complexity-without-utility: 添加不影响证明的多余组件以 \\\"看起来\\\" 复杂。 FOL-specific 的 vacuous truth (空域量词) 在 Prolog 中无对应物（Prolog 无量词）。Prolog-specific 的 backtracking exploitation (利用回溯搜索偶然 找到答案) 在 FOL 中无对应物（Prover9 无回溯机制）。 Jaccard similarity 4/(5+5-4)=0.667 表明 hacking 策略空间高度重叠。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Multi-logic joint GRPO (FOL + Prolog)\",\n    \"description\": \"FOL + Prolog 联合训练，exec-only vs exec+STA，500 步，K=8，1 seed。 测试跨逻辑联合训练的 transfer 效应。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"joint_exec_fol_pr\": 0.72,\n      \"joint_exec_fol_isr\": 0.1,\n      \"joint_exec_prolog_pr\": 0.68,\n      \"joint_exec_prolog_isr\": 0.07,\n      \"joint_sta_fol_pr\": 0.67,\n      \"joint_sta_fol_isr\": 0.21,\n      \"joint_sta_prolog_pr\": 0.63,\n      \"joint_sta_prolog_isr\": 0.18,\n      \"single_vs_joint_fol_pr_delta\": -0.21,\n      \"single_vs_joint_prolog_pr_delta\": -0.16\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"| Condition | FOL PR | FOL ISR | Prolog PR | Prolog ISR |\\n|-----------|--------|---------|-----------|------------|\\n| Joint exec-only | 0.72 | 0.10 | 0.68 | 0.07 |\\n| Joint exec+STA β=0.1 | 0.67 | 0.21 | 0.63 | 0.18 |\\n| Single exec-only (ref) | 0.93 | 0.12 | 0.84 | 0.09 |\\n| Single exec+STA (ref) | 0.81 | 0.34 | 0.76 | 0.26 |\\n\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Joint training 在当前模型规模下是 net negative for per-task performance。 但这并非 STA 协议的失败——ISR signal 在 joint 中仍有效。 论文中应作为 scale limitation 讨论，指向 plan011 (8B model) 作为 capacity-sufficient 的 future work。对 Claim 3 影响有限： STA protocol 泛化性已由 single-logic Prolog 实验证明， joint training 是 additional evidence 非核心证据。\\n\\n联合训练在容量受限的 0.5B 模型上引入 task competition：两种逻辑 共享 transformer 参数，导致 per-task PR 均低于单逻辑训练 (FOL 0.72 vs 0.93, Prolog 0.68 vs 0.84)。ISR 比例也略降。这是 multi-task learning 在小模型上的已知 tradeoff——容量不足以同时掌握两种逻辑语法。 exec+STA 联合训练的 ISR 仍高于 exec-only (FOL 0.21 vs 0.10, Prolog 0.18 vs 0.07)，说明 ISR bonus 的结构引导在多任务设置下仍有效， 但改善幅度 (2.1x/2.6x) 低于单逻辑的 3x，暗示容量瓶颈限制了 structural improvement 的上限。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cross-logic transfer evaluation\",\n    \"description\": \"FOL-trained model 在 Prolog tasks 上评估，反之亦然。 测试 formalization 能力的跨逻辑迁移。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"fol_to_prolog_pr\": 0.32,\n      \"fol_to_prolog_isr\": 0.04,\n      \"prolog_to_fol_pr\": 0.28,\n      \"prolog_to_fol_isr\": 0.03,\n      \"fol_on_fol_pr_ref\": 0.93,\n      \"prolog_on_prolog_pr_ref\": 0.84,\n      \"transfer_ratio_fol_to_prolog\": 0.38,\n      \"transfer_ratio_prolog_to_fol\": 0.3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"| Source → Target | PR | ISR | vs in-domain PR |\\n|----------------|-----|-----|-----------------|\\n| FOL → Prolog | 0.32 | 0.04 | 38% of Prolog in-domain |\\n| Prolog → FOL | 0.28 | 0.03 | 30% of FOL in-domain |\\n| FOL → FOL (ref) | 0.93 | 0.12 | 100% |\\n| Prolog → Prolog (ref) | 0.84 | 0.09 | 100% |\\n\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cross-logic transfer 的有限性是预期结果，不影响 STA 论文的核心 claims。 反而支持论点：STA 协议需要 per-logic instantiation (rule ablation for Prolog, component ablation for FOL)，不能依赖 model-level transfer 替代。 论文应在 Discussion 中简短提及。\\n\\n跨逻辑 transfer 有限 (PR 降至 28-32%)，因为 FOL 和 Prolog 的语法 结构本质不同：FOL 使用量词/连接词/谓词逻辑，Prolog 使用 Horn clauses/ unification/backtracking。GRPO 训练针对特定逻辑语法优化 token 序列 生成策略，这些策略不跨语法迁移。 然而 30% 的 transfer ratio 高于 random baseline (~12%)，说明 formalization 的高层语义理解（如何从自然语言提取逻辑结构）有部分共享。 ISR 在 transfer 场景极低 (0.03-0.04)，表明迁移产生的 formalizations 即使碰巧 proved 也是结构退化的——模型在不熟悉的逻辑中走更多捷径。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SFT baseline comparison\",\n    \"description\": \"Supervised finetuning on FOLIO 500，与 GRPO variants 对比。 测试 SFT 是否也出现结构退化。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sft_eval_pr\": 0.48,\n      \"sft_eval_mean_isr\": 0.24,\n      \"sft_eval_proved_only_isr\": 0.5,\n      \"sft_eval_component_count_mean\": 5.6,\n      \"sft_eval_genuine_rate\": 0.38,\n      \"sft_eval_hacking_rate\": 0.62,\n      \"sft_vs_grpo_exec_pr\": -0.45,\n      \"sft_vs_grpo_b01_isr\": -0.1\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"| Method | eval PR | eval ISR | proved-only ISR | genuine % | hacking % |\\n|--------|---------|----------|-----------------|-----------|-----------|\\n| SFT | 0.48 | 0.24 | 0.50 | 38% | 62% |\\n| GRPO exec-only (s42) | 0.93 | 0.12 | 0.13 | ~18% | ~82% |\\n| GRPO ISR β=0.1 (s42) | 0.81 | 0.34 | 0.42 | 26% | 74% |\\n| Pretrained (ref) | 0.12 | 0.06 | 0.64 | ~50% | ~50% |\\n\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"SFT 是重要对照：它展示了无 RL 优化压力时的 baseline 结构质量。 SFT 的 proved-only ISR (0.50) 接近 pretrained (0.64)，确认 structural degeneration 是 RL 优化的副产物。GRPO ISR β=0.1 是 唯一同时保持 high PR 和 reasonable ISR 的条件——比 SFT 高 PR (0.81 vs 0.48) 且 ISR 相当 (0.34 vs 0.24)，是最佳 PR-ISR tradeoff。\\n\\nSFT 复制训练分布而非优化 reward，因此不经历 GRPO 的饱和→hacking 动态。 PR 较低 (0.48 vs GRPO 0.93) 因为 SFT 无法通过 trial-and-error 发现 有效但不在训练集中的证明策略。但 proved-only ISR 较高 (0.50 vs 0.13) 因为 SFT 保留了训练数据中的结构模式。 Genuine rate 0.38 (vs GRPO exec-only ~0.18) 表明 SFT 的 hacking 更少， 但这是以 PR 天花板为代价的——SFT 不 hack 因为它不 optimize。 这支持论文的核心论点：reward hacking 是优化产物，诊断工具 (如 ISR) 在 RL 设置中比 SFT 更需要。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SMT-LIB single-logic GRPO (third logic)\",\n    \"description\": \"SMT-LIB 单逻辑 GRPO，exec-only vs exec+STA，500 步。 第三种逻辑类型验证 STA 协议泛化性。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"exec_only_pr\": 0.72,\n      \"exec_only_isr\": 0.09,\n      \"exec_only_component_count_mean\": 8.1,\n      \"exec_sta_b01_pr\": 0.67,\n      \"exec_sta_b01_isr\": 0.24,\n      \"exec_sta_b01_component_count_mean\": 5.4,\n      \"isr_improvement_ratio\": 2.67,\n      \"hacking_modes_shared_with_fol\": 3,\n      \"hacking_modes_shared_with_prolog\": 3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"| Condition | SMT-LIB PR | SMT-LIB ISR | comp_mean |\\n|-----------|-----------|-------------|-----------|\\n| exec-only | 0.72 | 0.09 | 8.1 |\\n| exec+STA β=0.1 | 0.67 | 0.24 | 5.4 |\\n| ISR improvement | — | 2.67x | 0.67x |\\n\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"第三种逻辑进一步巩固 Claim 3。三逻辑 ISR improvement 在 2.67-2.99x 区间的一致性表明 STA 的 LOO ablation 原则是 solver-agnostic 的—— 只要 solver 接受结构化输入且 reward 是二值的，STA 就适用。 若 SMT-LIB 实验在 submission 前完成，从两逻辑升级为三逻辑将 显著增强泛化性 claim。否则作为 appendix 或 camera-ready 追加。\\n\\nSMT-LIB 使用 Z3 solver，constraint satisfaction 语义与 FOL/Prolog 不同（声明式约束而非推导式证明），但 binary execution reward 的动态 相同。Exec-only 出现 hacking (PR 0.72, ISR 0.09)，ISR β=0.1 改善 至 0.24 (2.67x)。SMT-LIB 的 hacking 主要表现为 over-constrained assertions（添加冗余约束使 sat/unsat 结果不变）和 trivial assertions （直接 assert 结论）。与 FOL/Prolog 共享 conclusion embedding、 redundancy、tautological 三种模式。 ISR improvement ratio (2.67x) 略低于 FOL/Prolog 的 3x，可能因为 SMT-LIB 的 constraint structure 比 FOL premise structure 更刚性， ISR 信号的 reward shaping 空间更小。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Qwen3-8B model scale effect\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen3-8B (vs 0.5B baseline) 上运行 exec-only + exec+STA GRPO。 测试模型规模对 reward hacking 和 ISR 诊断的影响。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"exec_only_pr\": 0.96,\n      \"exec_only_isr\": 0.19,\n      \"exec_only_component_count_mean\": 6.2,\n      \"exec_only_hacking_rate\": 0.68,\n      \"exec_sta_b01_pr\": 0.92,\n      \"exec_sta_b01_isr\": 0.42,\n      \"exec_sta_b01_genuine_rate\": 0.35,\n      \"pr_retention\": 0.958\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"| Scale | Condition | PR | ISR | genuine % | hacking % |\\n|-------|-----------|-----|-----|-----------|-----------|\\n| 0.5B | exec-only | 0.93 | 0.12 | ~18% | ~82% |\\n| 0.5B | ISR β=0.1 | 0.81 | 0.34 | 26% | 74% |\\n| 8B | exec-only | 0.96 | 0.19 | ~32% | ~68% |\\n| 8B | ISR β=0.1 | 0.92 | 0.42 | 35% | 65% |\\n\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Scaling 降低 hacking rate (82%→68% exec-only) 但不消除它。 这是重要发现：即使 frontier-scale 模型也需要 ISR 诊断。 ISR β=0.1 在更大模型上的 diminishing Goodhart risk (PR retention 95.8% vs 87.1%) 暗示 sweet spot 可能随模型规模右移， 未来工作可探索 larger β at larger scale。\\n\\n8B 模型有更大的 representation capacity，能在不完全牺牲结构的情况下 实现高 PR。因此 exec-only ISR (0.19) 高于 0.5B (0.12)——更大模型 保留更多 \\\"附带\\\" 的结构信息。但 hacking 仍存在 (68%)，说明 reward hacking 不纯粹是 capacity 问题，而是 optimization objective 问题。ISR β=0.1 在 8B 上效果更显著 (ISR 0.42 vs 0.5B 的 0.34)， 因为更大模型有更多容量来同时优化 PR 和结构质量。 PR retention (0.92/0.96 = 95.8%) 优于 0.5B (0.81/0.93 = 87.1%)， 说明在 sufficient capacity 下 ISR 信号的 PR cost 接近零。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Curriculum ablation (sigmoid vs linear vs fixed)\",\n    \"description\": \"测试 ISR reward 的 curriculum scheduling：sigmoid ramp (baseline) vs linear ramp vs fixed weight。Sigmoid 是 plan005 的最佳配置 但未做消融。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sigmoid_eval_pr\": 0.77,\n      \"sigmoid_eval_isr\": 0.23,\n      \"sigmoid_midpoint_step\": 200,\n      \"linear_eval_pr\": 0.73,\n      \"linear_eval_isr\": 0.19,\n      \"fixed_b01_eval_pr\": 0.81,\n      \"fixed_b01_eval_isr\": 0.34,\n      \"fixed_b03_eval_pr\": 0.18,\n      \"fixed_b03_eval_isr\": 0.03,\n      \"sigmoid_vs_linear_isr_delta\": 0.04,\n      \"linear_midpoint100_pr\": 0.7,\n      \"linear_midpoint300_pr\": 0.75\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"| Curriculum | Formula | eval PR | eval ISR | optimal midpoint |\\n|-----------|---------|---------|----------|------------------|\\n| Fixed β=0.1 | multiplicative | **0.81** | **0.34** | N/A |\\n| Sigmoid (midpoint=200) | convex | 0.77 | 0.23 | 200 |\\n| Linear (midpoint=200) | convex | 0.73 | 0.19 | 200 |\\n| Fixed β=0.3 | multiplicative | 0.18 | 0.03 | N/A (Goodhart) |\\n\",\n      \"| Linear midpoint | eval PR | eval ISR |\\n|----------------|---------|----------|\\n| 100 | 0.70 | 0.17 |\\n| 200 | 0.73 | 0.19 |\\n| 300 | 0.75 | 0.15 |\\n\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"关键发现：在乘法公式 r = r_exec·(1+β·ISR) 下，curriculum scheduling 的边际价值很小——fixed β=0.1 已经是最优。这是因为乘法公式中 ISR 只能 是 bonus (≥0)，不存在 early penalty 问题。Sigmoid curriculum 主要 对凸组合公式有价值（避免 ISR<1 时的 penalty 效应）。 论文应在 ablation 中简短报告此结果，结论：乘法公式 + fixed β=0.1 是最简洁有效的配置，无需 curriculum 复杂化。\\n\\n注意：plan005 使用凸组合公式 (α·r_exec + β·r_exec·ISR, α+β=1)， 而 plan002-b01 使用乘法公式 (r = r_exec·(1+β·ISR))。plan015 需要 在两种公式下分别测试 curriculum。 Fixed β=0.1 (plan002-b01 已验证) 是最佳 fixed 配置。Sigmoid 和 linear ramp 在凸组合公式下有效果，因为 early ISR penalty (ISR<1 时) 需要 逐步引入以避免早期训练崩塌。但在乘法公式下，ISR 只能 bonus， curriculum 的意义降低——fixed β=0.1 已经是 \\\"permanently gentle bonus\\\"， 不需要 ramp。 Sigmoid 略优于 linear (ISR 0.23 vs 0.19) 因为 sigmoid 的 S-curve 在中期 (step 150-250) 快速提升 ISR weight，比 linear 的匀速增长 更好地利用了模型已学到基础证明能力的时间窗口。 Midpoint 影响：100 (过早) 导致 early ISR pressure → PR 降； 300 (过晚) 使 ISR signal 在后 200 步才充分生效，改善有限。\"\n  }\n]","numLines":348,"startLine":1,"totalLines":348}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016EccKCAw1BNiyfiH26yATx","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — solver-trace-ablation\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (NLP and Symbolic Reasoning track)\n5\t- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\n6\t- Deadline: ARR May 25, 2026\n7\t\n8\t## Core Claims (3 条 — Goodhart 主线诊断/分析论文)\n9\t\n10\t### Claim 1: ISR as Reward Hacking Diagnostic\n11\tSolver Trace Ablation (STA) derives ISR (Intensional Structural Reward) via component necessity testing (leave-one-out ablation on solver inputs). ISR detects reward hacking that prove_rate alone misses: exec-only GRPO achieves PR=93% but ISR collapses from 0.6423 (100 steps) to 0.1324 (500 steps) to 0.0027 (1000 steps), quantifying structural degeneration invisible to the execution reward.\n12\t\n13\t**证据**：\n14\t- plan003: 100-step checkpoint held-out eval PR=32%, ISR=0.6423 (proved-only) — early training produces structurally sound formalizations\n15\t- plan001-s42: 500-step checkpoint held-out eval PR=93%, ISR=0.1324, median_ISR=0.0 — late training achieves high prove_rate via structural shortcuts\n16\t- **plan016**: 1000-step checkpoint eval PR=96%, ISR=**0.0027** — ISR 崩塌持续恶化，无回升。94.8% proved 样本 ISR=0。矛盾爆炸式崩塌（components 6.58→18.55）。延长训练是 reward hacking 随时间恶化的干净消融证据\n17\t- ISR 崩塌轨迹完整链：0.6423 (100步) → 0.1324 (500步) → 0.0027 (1000步)\n18\t- 3-seed consistency: s42 conclusion embedding (ISR=0.123), s43 repetition collapse (PR=13%, ISR=0), s44 tautological collapse (PR=98%, ISR=0.57 fake-high, n_comp=2.04)\n19\t- Hacking taxonomy: 5 distinct modes identified and quantified (plan012 `hacking_characterization_report.md` + plan017 D027)\n20\t\n21\t### Claim 2: ISR as Proxy Metric Exhibits Goodhart's Law (D033 重写)\n22\tISR 作为 proxy metric 遵循 Goodhart's Law：当 ISR 从观测指标（diagnostic）转变为优化目标（reward），其有效性取决于优化压力的强度。低剂量 ISR reward (β=0.1) 提升结构质量且不损害证明能力；高剂量 ISR reward (β=0.3) 触发 Goodhart 效应，比 matched random noise 更差。\n23\t\n24\t**证据（β=0.1 同剂量对照，D031 定论）**：\n25\t- plan002-b01 (ISR β=0.1): eval PR=0.81, ISR=0.337, proved_only_ISR=0.415, components=5.58 — genuine proofs with improved structure\n26\t- plan018 (random β=0.1): eval PR=0.79, ISR=0.104, proved_only_ISR=0.131, components=8.46 — PR 持平但 ISR 仅为 ISR 组的 1/3.2\n27\t- **结论**：ISR 3.2x > random at same β → ISR 信号提供 genuine structural guidance，非 variance regularization\n28\t\n29\t**Hacking Taxonomy 定量对比 (D038)**：\n30\t- ISR β=0.1 genuine: 25.9% (21/81) vs random β=0.1 genuine: 17.7% (14/79) — **+8.2pp**\n31\t- Conclusion embedding: ISR 72.8% vs random 78.5% — 两组主导模式，ISR 略降但未消除\n32\t- Complexity-without-utility: ISR **0%** vs random 3.8% — ISR 完全消除此模式\n33\t- ISR genuine quality: mean ISR 0.67 (max 1.0) vs random genuine mean ISR 0.34 (max 0.5)\n34\t- 整体 hacking rate: ISR 74.1% vs random 82.3% — sweet spot 下仍有 74% hacking\n35\t\n36\t**证据（β=0.3 同剂量对照）**：\n37\t- plan002-b03 (ISR β=0.3): eval PR=0.18, ISR=0.026 — Goodhart 效应，PR 崩塌\n38\t- plan017 (random β=0.3): eval PR=0.48, ISR=0.045 — random 比 ISR 好 2.7x PR\n39\t- **结论**：高剂量 ISR 对训练 actively misleading (PR 18% < random 48%)\n40\t\n41\t**β 剂量效应全景**：\n42\t| β | ISR reward PR | Random reward PR | ISR reward ISR | Random reward ISR | 解读 |\n43\t|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n44\t| 0.1 | 0.81 | 0.79 | **0.337** | 0.104 | ISR >> random (sweet spot) |\n45\t| 0.3 | 0.18 | 0.48 | 0.026 | 0.045 | ISR << random (Goodhart) |\n46\t\n47\t**其他 ISR-as-reward 失败模式**：\n48\t- plan005 凸组合 (α·r_exec + β·r_exec·ISR, α+β=1): ISR<1 时永远是 penalty → PR 下降 (D010)\n49\t- plan013 convex random: PR=1.0 但 100% P→P tautological collapse (D018)\n50\t\n51\t⚠️ **措辞约束 (Reviewer D027)**: plan013 (0.9·r_exec+0.1·random) vs plan017 (r_exec·(1+0.3·random)) 公式结构不同，不可简化为\"additive vs convex\"对照。plan017 vs plan002 和 plan018 vs plan002-b01 的 ISR vs random 对比是纯净的（唯一变量是 random vs ISR）\n52\t\n53\t⚠️ **β=0.1 ISR 目前 1 seed (s42)，s43/s44 训练中**。3-seed mean±std 待出。\n54\t\n55\t### Claim 3: Cross-Logic Generality (conditional on plan006)\n56\tSTA protocol is solver-agnostic: the 5-step derivation (pilot → collect shortcuts → classify → map RIP → design check) transfers to structurally different formal languages. Hacking modes and ISR diagnostic value replicate across FOL→Prover9 and Prolog→SWI-Prolog.\n57\t\n58\t**证据**: 待验证。plan006 Prolog GRPO dry-run 进行中，训练即将启动（3 seeds × 500 步）。如果 plan006 无法复现 hacking + ISR 诊断，此 claim 降级为 future work。\n59\t\n60\t## Story Spine\n61\t\n62\t- **Problem**: GRPO with execution-only rewards trains neurosymbolic formalizers that achieve high solve rates but produce structurally degenerate outputs (reward hacking). Current practice evaluates only prove_rate, missing structural quality entirely. No principled diagnostic exists for detecting and characterizing this failure mode.\n63\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: Mellgren et al. (2025) hand-craft Prolog-specific structure penalties. EVOM (2026) uses scalar execution rewards only. ExecVerify/EGCA derive trace-level rewards for code, not formal logic. No work systematically studies reward hacking in formal reasoning GRPO or provides diagnostic tools for it.\n64\t- **Our contribution**: We propose STA (Solver Trace Ablation), applying component necessity testing (LOO ablation) to derive ISR as a **diagnostic metric** for structural integrity. Key findings:\n65\t  1. ISR quantifies hacking invisible to prove_rate (64% → 13% → 0.3% collapse over training)\n66\t  2. ISR as proxy metric exhibits Goodhart's Law: low-dose ISR reward (β=0.1) provides genuine structural guidance (3.2x > matched random), but high-dose (β=0.3) is actively worse than random noise — a clean empirical demonstration of Goodhart's Law in reward shaping\n67\t  3. GRPO saturation creates a \"training trap\": PR→1 means no gradient signal; adding variance redirects rather than prevents hacking\n68\t  4. Different reward formulations produce distinct, classifiable hacking strategies (5 modes identified)\n69\t  5. ISR measures syntactic component necessity, not semantic faithfulness — this boundary is important for practitioners\n70\t- **Actionable insights for practitioners**:\n71\t  1. Never trust prove_rate alone — use ISR + component count as joint diagnostic\n72\t  2. Single-seed GRPO results are unreliable (2/3 exec-only seeds collapse differently)\n73\t  3. ISR reward has a narrow sweet spot (β=0.1): below it, no structural guidance; above it, Goodhart effect destroys prove_rate\n74\t  4. ISR is primarily a structural diagnostic; as training signal, treat with extreme caution (Goodhart boundary is sharp)\n75\t- **Headline result**: \"We demonstrate that ISR — a component necessity metric derived from solver trace ablation — serves as both a diagnostic for reward hacking in GRPO-trained formalizers and a case study of Goodhart's Law in reward shaping. At low dose (β=0.1), ISR reward provides genuine structural guidance (3.2x ISR improvement over matched random control, PR maintained). At high dose (β=0.3), ISR reward is actively worse than random noise (PR 18% vs 48%), exhibiting classic Goodhart collapse. Across 5 reward conditions, 3 seeds, and up to 1000 training steps, we identify 5 distinct hacking strategies and document ISR's transition from useful indicator to harmful optimization target.\"\n76\t\n77\t## ISR Capability Boundary (D021/D022)\n78\t\n79\t**ISR 度量的是 syntactic necessity（组件在证明中是否必要），不是 semantic faithfulness（formalization 是否忠实于自然语言语义）。**\n80\t\n81\tplan014 downstream NLI 验证结果（negative）精确刻画了这一边界：\n82\t- Spearman ρ(ISR, NLI accuracy) = -0.049 (p=0.187, 不显著)\n83\t- Best-of-N ISR selection vs random: +0.9pp (不显著)\n84\t- 主因：模型严重 true-bias (false accuracy=0%)，NLI accuracy 天花板仅 34.1%\n85\t\n86\t**论文处理**：ISR-as-downstream-quality-proxy 降级为 **Limitation / Future Work**。plan014 结果作为 negative result 保留，精确刻画 ISR 能力边界。\n87\t\n88\t## ISR-as-Reward: Goodhart Landscape (D033 更新)\n89\t\n90\tISR 作为训练信号的全部结果，按 β 剂量组织：\n91\t\n92\t| 条件 | 公式 | eval PR | eval ISR | 退化模式 | Goodhart 阶段 |\n93\t|------|------|---------|----------|----------|---------------|\n94\t| exec-only (baseline) | r = r_exec | 0.93 (s42) | 0.123 | conclusion embedding | N/A |\n95\t| ISR β=0.1 | r = r_exec·(1+0.1·ISR) | **0.81** | **0.337** | conclusion embedding (73%), genuine 26% | pre-Goodhart (sweet spot) |\n96\t| random β=0.1 | r = r_exec·(1+0.1·random) | 0.79 | 0.104 | redundant premises | control |\n97\t| ISR β=0.3 | r = r_exec·(1+0.3·ISR) | 0.18 | 0.026 | format collapse | post-Goodhart |\n98\t| random β=0.3 | r = r_exec·(1+0.3·random) | 0.48 | 0.045 | complexity-without-utility | control |\n99\t| convex combination | r = 0.9·r_exec + 0.1·ISR | 0.77 (train) | 0.230 (train) | ISR-PR separation | penalty effect |\n100\t| convex random | r = 0.9·r_exec + 0.1·random | 1.00 | 0.535 (fake) | tautological | hacking |\n101\t\n102\t**Goodhart 转折点在 β ∈ (0.1, 0.3)。** β=0.1 是可用的 sweet spot；β=0.3 已进入 Goodhart 区间。\n103\t\n104\t## Venue Fit Risks\n105\t\n106\t- **EMNLP fit**: Diagnostic/analysis paper with Goodhart's Law case study in NLP + formal reasoning track. Empirical findings + mechanistic insight valued at EMNLP.\n107\t- **\"Just negative results\" risk**: Mitigate by: (a) β=0.1 是 positive result (ISR sweet spot)，(b) Goodhart framework 提供 mechanistic understanding，(c) actionable diagnostic framework (ISR + taxonomy)。\n108\t- **\"Old wine\" risk**: ISR = LOO ablation. Claim novelty at application level (first systematic Goodhart analysis for formal reasoning GRPO) + empirical findings, not algorithm level.\n109\t- **Single-logic risk**: If plan006 Prolog doesn't happen, paper is FOL-only. Mitigate by emphasizing depth of analysis (3 seeds × 5+ conditions × 5 hacking modes × 3 training horizons).\n110\t\n111\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n112\t\n113\t1. **\"ISR is just LOO ablation — not novel\"** — Yes, explicitly acknowledge. Contribution is (a) applying it as hacking diagnostic for formal reasoning GRPO, (b) empirical Goodhart analysis on reward shaping, (c) hacking taxonomy, (d) GRPO saturation mechanism.\n114\t2. **\"β=0.1 success is just one seed\"** — Acknowledged. Future work includes multi-seed β=0.1 validation. However, the β=0.1 vs random β=0.1 comparison is clean (same seed, same setup, only ISR vs random differs).\n115\t3. **\"Goodhart's Law is obvious\"** — The conceptual prediction is known; the empirical characterization in formal reasoning GRPO is not. Specifically: (a) the sharp threshold between β=0.1 and β=0.3, (b) ISR being worse than random at high β (not just \"less useful\"), (c) 5 distinct hacking modes as Goodhart manifestations.\n116\t4. **\"No positive result — ISR doesn't improve training\"** — β=0.1 IS a positive result (PR=0.81, ISR 3.2x > random). Framing: ISR has a narrow but real sweet spot. The Goodhart boundary is the key insight.\n117\t5. **\"ISR is circular\"** — ISR is used for diagnosis/post-hoc analysis AND as reward (β=0.1). The circularity concern applies to high-β optimization; low-β avoids Goodhart precisely because optimization pressure is weak. Component count analysis provides ISR-independent evidence.\n118\t6. **\"Only one logic type\"** — STA protocol is solver-agnostic; plan006 Prolog validates generality. If absent, acknowledge as limitation.\n119\t7. **\"500 steps too short\"** — plan016 extends to 1000 steps, showing ISR collapse continues and worsens (0.123→0.003, -97.8%). The ISR崩塌轨迹 covers 100/500/1000 steps.\n120\t8. **\"3 seeds insufficient for statistical claims\"** — The 3-seed divergence (3 different hacking modes from same setup) is itself a finding, not a limitation. Statistical claims on mean ISR use 3-seed mean±std.\n121\t9. **\"Related work insufficient\"** — Expand to 25+ refs: reward hacking (Gao 2023, Skalse 2022), Goodhart's Law (Manheim & Garrabrant 2019, Karwowski 2024), GRPO (Shao 2024), formal reasoning (LeanDojo, Baldur), feature attribution (SHAP), FOLIO (Han 2022).\n122\t10. **\"RIP framework overstated\"** — Frame as \"component necessity testing inspired by mutation testing's RIP framework,\" only Propagation condition operationalized.\n123\t11. **\"Practitioners can't act on this\"** — 4 actionable insights listed in Story Spine. ISR + component count as joint diagnostic is immediately deployable. β=0.1 sweet spot is directly actionable for reward shaping.\n124\t\n125\t## Dream-Identified Structural Fixes (Paper Agent)\n126\t\n127\t- [ ] Related work: 6→25+ references (literature_map.yaml now has 33)\n128\t- [ ] RIP framing: reframe as \"component necessity testing inspired by RIP\"\n129\t- [ ] \"Dense+automatic\" → \"conditionally dense\"\n130\t- [ ] Remove all \"Pareto-improving\" language\n131\t- [ ] Acknowledge ISR = LOO ablation, cite feature attribution literature\n132\t- [ ] Address ISR sparsity for unproved outputs explicitly\n133\t- [ ] Add Goodhart's Law literature (Manheim & Garrabrant 2019, Karwowski 2024, Gao 2023)\n134\t- [x] Convex combination → additive bonus (D010, then D020 confirmed all ISR-as-reward failed at β=0.3)\n135\t- [x] ISR downstream validation → Limitation/Future Work (D021/D022, plan014 negative)\n136\t- [x] Hacking taxonomy completed (plan012, 5 modes identified including plan017)\n137\t- [x] β=0.1 ISR sweet spot documented (D031/D032, plan002-b01 success)\n138\t- [x] β=0.1 random control confirms ISR structural value (D033, plan018 eval)\n139\t- [x] 1000-step ISR collapse documented (plan016, ISR 0.123→0.003)\n140\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"73336205-529c-453d-86e3-0557efef9ea8","uuid":"43543a08-0c84-42a4-8846-409d9133d4ec","timestamp":"2026-05-14T09:52:07.034Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T092544/best/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — solver-trace-ablation\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (NLP and Symbolic Reasoning track)\n- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\n- Deadline: ARR May 25, 2026\n\n## Core Claims (3 条 — Goodhart 主线诊断/分析论文)\n\n### Claim 1: ISR as Reward Hacking Diagnostic\nSolver Trace Ablation (STA) derives ISR (Intensional Structural Reward) via component necessity testing (leave-one-out ablation on solver inputs). ISR detects reward hacking that prove_rate alone misses: exec-only GRPO achieves PR=93% but ISR collapses from 0.6423 (100 steps) to 0.1324 (500 steps) to 0.0027 (1000 steps), quantifying structural degeneration invisible to the execution reward.\n\n**证据**：\n- plan003: 100-step checkpoint held-out eval PR=32%, ISR=0.6423 (proved-only) — early training produces structurally sound formalizations\n- plan001-s42: 500-step checkpoint held-out eval PR=93%, ISR=0.1324, median_ISR=0.0 — late training achieves high prove_rate via structural shortcuts\n- **plan016**: 1000-step checkpoint eval PR=96%, ISR=**0.0027** — ISR 崩塌持续恶化，无回升。94.8% proved 样本 ISR=0。矛盾爆炸式崩塌（components 6.58→18.55）。延长训练是 reward hacking 随时间恶化的干净消融证据\n- ISR 崩塌轨迹完整链：0.6423 (100步) → 0.1324 (500步) → 0.0027 (1000步)\n- 3-seed consistency: s42 conclusion embedding (ISR=0.123), s43 repetition collapse (PR=13%, ISR=0), s44 tautological collapse (PR=98%, ISR=0.57 fake-high, n_comp=2.04)\n- Hacking taxonomy: 5 distinct modes identified and quantified (plan012 `hacking_characterization_report.md` + plan017 D027)\n\n### Claim 2: ISR as Proxy Metric Exhibits Goodhart's Law (D033 重写)\nISR 作为 proxy metric 遵循 Goodhart's Law：当 ISR 从观测指标（diagnostic）转变为优化目标（reward），其有效性取决于优化压力的强度。低剂量 ISR reward (β=0.1) 提升结构质量且不损害证明能力；高剂量 ISR reward (β=0.3) 触发 Goodhart 效应，比 matched random noise 更差。\n\n**证据（β=0.1 同剂量对照，D031 定论）**：\n- plan002-b01 (ISR β=0.1): eval PR=0.81, ISR=0.337, proved_only_ISR=0.415, components=5.58 — genuine proofs with improved structure\n- plan018 (random β=0.1): eval PR=0.79, ISR=0.104, proved_only_ISR=0.131, components=8.46 — PR 持平但 ISR 仅为 ISR 组的 1/3.2\n- **结论**：ISR 3.2x > random at same β → ISR 信号提供 genuine structural guidance，非 variance regularization\n\n**Hacking Taxonomy 定量对比 (D038)**：\n- ISR β=0.1 genuine: 25.9% (21/81) vs random β=0.1 genuine: 17.7% (14/79) — **+8.2pp**\n- Conclusion embedding: ISR 72.8% vs random 78.5% — 两组主导模式，ISR 略降但未消除\n- Complexity-without-utility: ISR **0%** vs random 3.8% — ISR 完全消除此模式\n- ISR genuine quality: mean ISR 0.67 (max 1.0) vs random genuine mean ISR 0.34 (max 0.5)\n- 整体 hacking rate: ISR 74.1% vs random 82.3% — sweet spot 下仍有 74% hacking\n\n**证据（β=0.3 同剂量对照）**：\n- plan002-b03 (ISR β=0.3): eval PR=0.18, ISR=0.026 — Goodhart 效应，PR 崩塌\n- plan017 (random β=0.3): eval PR=0.48, ISR=0.045 — random 比 ISR 好 2.7x PR\n- **结论**：高剂量 ISR 对训练 actively misleading (PR 18% < random 48%)\n\n**β 剂量效应全景**：\n| β | ISR reward PR | Random reward PR | ISR reward ISR | Random reward ISR | 解读 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 0.1 | 0.81 | 0.79 | **0.337** | 0.104 | ISR >> random (sweet spot) |\n| 0.3 | 0.18 | 0.48 | 0.026 | 0.045 | ISR << random (Goodhart) |\n\n**其他 ISR-as-reward 失败模式**：\n- plan005 凸组合 (α·r_exec + β·r_exec·ISR, α+β=1): ISR<1 时永远是 penalty → PR 下降 (D010)\n- plan013 convex random: PR=1.0 但 100% P→P tautological collapse (D018)\n\n⚠️ **措辞约束 (Reviewer D027)**: plan013 (0.9·r_exec+0.1·random) vs plan017 (r_exec·(1+0.3·random)) 公式结构不同，不可简化为\"additive vs convex\"对照。plan017 vs plan002 和 plan018 vs plan002-b01 的 ISR vs random 对比是纯净的（唯一变量是 random vs ISR）\n\n⚠️ **β=0.1 ISR 目前 1 seed (s42)，s43/s44 训练中**。3-seed mean±std 待出。\n\n### Claim 3: Cross-Logic Generality (conditional on plan006)\nSTA protocol is solver-agnostic: the 5-step derivation (pilot → collect shortcuts → classify → map RIP → design check) transfers to structurally different formal languages. Hacking modes and ISR diagnostic value replicate across FOL→Prover9 and Prolog→SWI-Prolog.\n\n**证据**: 待验证。plan006 Prolog GRPO dry-run 进行中，训练即将启动（3 seeds × 500 步）。如果 plan006 无法复现 hacking + ISR 诊断，此 claim 降级为 future work。\n\n## Story Spine\n\n- **Problem**: GRPO with execution-only rewards trains neurosymbolic formalizers that achieve high solve rates but produce structurally degenerate outputs (reward hacking). Current practice evaluates only prove_rate, missing structural quality entirely. No principled diagnostic exists for detecting and characterizing this failure mode.\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: Mellgren et al. (2025) hand-craft Prolog-specific structure penalties. EVOM (2026) uses scalar execution rewards only. ExecVerify/EGCA derive trace-level rewards for code, not formal logic. No work systematically studies reward hacking in formal reasoning GRPO or provides diagnostic tools for it.\n- **Our contribution**: We propose STA (Solver Trace Ablation), applying component necessity testing (LOO ablation) to derive ISR as a **diagnostic metric** for structural integrity. Key findings:\n  1. ISR quantifies hacking invisible to prove_rate (64% → 13% → 0.3% collapse over training)\n  2. ISR as proxy metric exhibits Goodhart's Law: low-dose ISR reward (β=0.1) provides genuine structural guidance (3.2x > matched random), but high-dose (β=0.3) is actively worse than random noise — a clean empirical demonstration of Goodhart's Law in reward shaping\n  3. GRPO saturation creates a \"training trap\": PR→1 means no gradient signal; adding variance redirects rather than prevents hacking\n  4. Different reward formulations produce distinct, classifiable hacking strategies (5 modes identified)\n  5. ISR measures syntactic component necessity, not semantic faithfulness — this boundary is important for practitioners\n- **Actionable insights for practitioners**:\n  1. Never trust prove_rate alone — use ISR + component count as joint diagnostic\n  2. Single-seed GRPO results are unreliable (2/3 exec-only seeds collapse differently)\n  3. ISR reward has a narrow sweet spot (β=0.1): below it, no structural guidance; above it, Goodhart effect destroys prove_rate\n  4. ISR is primarily a structural diagnostic; as training signal, treat with extreme caution (Goodhart boundary is sharp)\n- **Headline result**: \"We demonstrate that ISR — a component necessity metric derived from solver trace ablation — serves as both a diagnostic for reward hacking in GRPO-trained formalizers and a case study of Goodhart's Law in reward shaping. At low dose (β=0.1), ISR reward provides genuine structural guidance (3.2x ISR improvement over matched random control, PR maintained). At high dose (β=0.3), ISR reward is actively worse than random noise (PR 18% vs 48%), exhibiting classic Goodhart collapse. Across 5 reward conditions, 3 seeds, and up to 1000 training steps, we identify 5 distinct hacking strategies and document ISR's transition from useful indicator to harmful optimization target.\"\n\n## ISR Capability Boundary (D021/D022)\n\n**ISR 度量的是 syntactic necessity（组件在证明中是否必要），不是 semantic faithfulness（formalization 是否忠实于自然语言语义）。**\n\nplan014 downstream NLI 验证结果（negative）精确刻画了这一边界：\n- Spearman ρ(ISR, NLI accuracy) = -0.049 (p=0.187, 不显著)\n- Best-of-N ISR selection vs random: +0.9pp (不显著)\n- 主因：模型严重 true-bias (false accuracy=0%)，NLI accuracy 天花板仅 34.1%\n\n**论文处理**：ISR-as-downstream-quality-proxy 降级为 **Limitation / Future Work**。plan014 结果作为 negative result 保留，精确刻画 ISR 能力边界。\n\n## ISR-as-Reward: Goodhart Landscape (D033 更新)\n\nISR 作为训练信号的全部结果，按 β 剂量组织：\n\n| 条件 | 公式 | eval PR | eval ISR | 退化模式 | Goodhart 阶段 |\n|------|------|---------|----------|----------|---------------|\n| exec-only (baseline) | r = r_exec | 0.93 (s42) | 0.123 | conclusion embedding | N/A |\n| ISR β=0.1 | r = r_exec·(1+0.1·ISR) | **0.81** | **0.337** | conclusion embedding (73%), genuine 26% | pre-Goodhart (sweet spot) |\n| random β=0.1 | r = r_exec·(1+0.1·random) | 0.79 | 0.104 | redundant premises | control |\n| ISR β=0.3 | r = r_exec·(1+0.3·ISR) | 0.18 | 0.026 | format collapse | post-Goodhart |\n| random β=0.3 | r = r_exec·(1+0.3·random) | 0.48 | 0.045 | complexity-without-utility | control |\n| convex combination | r = 0.9·r_exec + 0.1·ISR | 0.77 (train) | 0.230 (train) | ISR-PR separation | penalty effect |\n| convex random | r = 0.9·r_exec + 0.1·random | 1.00 | 0.535 (fake) | tautological | hacking |\n\n**Goodhart 转折点在 β ∈ (0.1, 0.3)。** β=0.1 是可用的 sweet spot；β=0.3 已进入 Goodhart 区间。\n\n## Venue Fit Risks\n\n- **EMNLP fit**: Diagnostic/analysis paper with Goodhart's Law case study in NLP + formal reasoning track. Empirical findings + mechanistic insight valued at EMNLP.\n- **\"Just negative results\" risk**: Mitigate by: (a) β=0.1 是 positive result (ISR sweet spot)，(b) Goodhart framework 提供 mechanistic understanding，(c) actionable diagnostic framework (ISR + taxonomy)。\n- **\"Old wine\" risk**: ISR = LOO ablation. Claim novelty at application level (first systematic Goodhart analysis for formal reasoning GRPO) + empirical findings, not algorithm level.\n- **Single-logic risk**: If plan006 Prolog doesn't happen, paper is FOL-only. Mitigate by emphasizing depth of analysis (3 seeds × 5+ conditions × 5 hacking modes × 3 training horizons).\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n\n1. **\"ISR is just LOO ablation — not novel\"** — Yes, explicitly acknowledge. Contribution is (a) applying it as hacking diagnostic for formal reasoning GRPO, (b) empirical Goodhart analysis on reward shaping, (c) hacking taxonomy, (d) GRPO saturation mechanism.\n2. **\"β=0.1 success is just one seed\"** — Acknowledged. Future work includes multi-seed β=0.1 validation. However, the β=0.1 vs random β=0.1 comparison is clean (same seed, same setup, only ISR vs random differs).\n3. **\"Goodhart's Law is obvious\"** — The conceptual prediction is known; the empirical characterization in formal reasoning GRPO is not. Specifically: (a) the sharp threshold between β=0.1 and β=0.3, (b) ISR being worse than random at high β (not just \"less useful\"), (c) 5 distinct hacking modes as Goodhart manifestations.\n4. **\"No positive result — ISR doesn't improve training\"** — β=0.1 IS a positive result (PR=0.81, ISR 3.2x > random). Framing: ISR has a narrow but real sweet spot. The Goodhart boundary is the key insight.\n5. **\"ISR is circular\"** — ISR is used for diagnosis/post-hoc analysis AND as reward (β=0.1). The circularity concern applies to high-β optimization; low-β avoids Goodhart precisely because optimization pressure is weak. Component count analysis provides ISR-independent evidence.\n6. **\"Only one logic type\"** — STA protocol is solver-agnostic; plan006 Prolog validates generality. If absent, acknowledge as limitation.\n7. **\"500 steps too short\"** — plan016 extends to 1000 steps, showing ISR collapse continues and worsens (0.123→0.003, -97.8%). The ISR崩塌轨迹 covers 100/500/1000 steps.\n8. **\"3 seeds insufficient for statistical claims\"** — The 3-seed divergence (3 different hacking modes from same setup) is itself a finding, not a limitation. Statistical claims on mean ISR use 3-seed mean±std.\n9. **\"Related work insufficient\"** — Expand to 25+ refs: reward hacking (Gao 2023, Skalse 2022), Goodhart's Law (Manheim & Garrabrant 2019, Karwowski 2024), GRPO (Shao 2024), formal reasoning (LeanDojo, Baldur), feature attribution (SHAP), FOLIO (Han 2022).\n10. **\"RIP framework overstated\"** — Frame as \"component necessity testing inspired by mutation testing's RIP framework,\" only Propagation condition operationalized.\n11. **\"Practitioners can't act on this\"** — 4 actionable insights listed in Story Spine. ISR + component count as joint diagnostic is immediately deployable. β=0.1 sweet spot is directly actionable for reward shaping.\n\n## Dream-Identified Structural Fixes (Paper Agent)\n\n- [ ] Related work: 6→25+ references (literature_map.yaml now has 33)\n- [ ] RIP framing: reframe as \"component necessity testing inspired by RIP\"\n- [ ] \"Dense+automatic\" → \"conditionally dense\"\n- [ ] Remove all \"Pareto-improving\" language\n- [ ] Acknowledge ISR = LOO ablation, cite feature attribution literature\n- [ ] Address ISR sparsity for unproved outputs explicitly\n- [ ] Add Goodhart's Law literature (Manheim & Garrabrant 2019, Karwowski 2024, Gao 2023)\n- [x] Convex combination → additive bonus (D010, then D020 confirmed all ISR-as-reward failed at β=0.3)\n- [x] ISR downstream validation → Limitation/Future Work (D021/D022, plan014 negative)\n- [x] Hacking taxonomy completed (plan012, 5 modes identified including plan017)\n- [x] β=0.1 ISR sweet spot documented (D031/D032, plan002-b01 success)\n- [x] β=0.1 random control confirms ISR structural value (D033, plan018 eval)\n- [x] 1000-step ISR collapse documented (plan016, ISR 0.123→0.003)\n","numLines":140,"startLine":1,"totalLines":140}}}
