{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01EjrKGZQu37W1L2WRfWpd5V","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. No ACL style available, but standard LaTeX packages are there. I'll use a standard article class with two-column layout. Let me now write the comprehensive paper.\n\nLet me write the full LaTeX paper. I need to be careful to:\n1. Cover all 13 experiments with dedicated tables/sections\n2. Use only data from the experiment JSON and paper_framing.md\n3. Structure it as a coherent EMNLP-quality paper\n\nLet me organize the paper structure:\n\n**Title**: Solver Trace Ablation: Diagnosing and Characterizing Reward Hacking in GRPO-Trained Formal Reasoners\n\n\n**Abstract**: Summarize all 3 claims\n**1. Introduction**: Problem, gap, contribution\n**2. Related Work**: Reward hacking, Goodhart's Law, GRPO, formal reasoning\n**3. Method**: STA protocol, ISR definition, O(1) vs O(N) ablation\n**4. Experimental Setup**: Model, data, training config\n**5. ISR as Reward Hacking Diagnostic** (Claim 1): ISR collapse trajectory across training steps, SFT baseline comparison, and O(1) vs O(N) ablation results\n**6. Scaling Laws and Generalization** (Claim 2): How ISR patterns change with model scale and transfer across domains\n**7. Mechanistic Analysis** (Claim 3): What solver traces reveal about internal reasoning degradation\n**8. Results and Discussion**: Present all 13 experiments with supporting tables and figures\n**9. Conclusion**: Implications for training robust formal reasoners Now I'm looking at the scaling experiments and multi-logic training results, then pulling in some specific numbers from the framing document to show how ISR degrades as we optimize for it—the proved-only baseline drops from 64% ISR at 100 steps down to nearly zero by 1000 steps, and when we push β to 0.3 the whole thing collapses with almost no proofs found.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1520,"cache_read_input_tokens":42322,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1520},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"73336205-529c-453d-86e3-0557efef9ea8","uuid":"127faa0c-c8ad-44db-8593-e5ad8270db33"}
